<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MALK Lughulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maliki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe na Maliki</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maliki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Malk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Imbuli Inoghile iyandikighwe ne</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maliki</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbuli inoghile iyandikighwe na Maliki ya chitabu chimwe mna pfitabu pfine ipfili mna Laghano lya Sambi ipfilonga mbuli tsa Yesu Kiristu. Chila chitabu chokemighwa Injili (mana yake Imbuli Inoghile). Tsapfandikighwa na tsina Matei, Maliki, Luka na Yohane. Chitabu chino cha Maliki chidodo kubita pfitabu pfiyaghe pfidatu. Pfipfila iwanu wolonga chitabu chino chilongola kwandikighwa kubita pfiyaghe, chandikighwa mne miyaka ya sitini na tano mbaka sabini kulawa Yesu hayakalile muisi. Na iwasomi wengi wotoghola ghendo ka tsachandikighwa mna isi ya Roma kuwaghuma ghumoyo wakiristu iwakalile Roma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maliki pfipfila iyamanyike ka Yohane Maliki, tsayang'ali yakwangagha na tsina Pauli na Balinaba, lekeni tsakalema kughendelela nawo mna ghumwanza ghwa kuwapetela iwanu Imbuli inoghile (Gham 13:13). Hambele tsakatoghola kwanga keli na Balinaba (Ghama 15:37-39). Maliki tsakamanyika ka sale wake mkulu na Petiri (Malk 1:5-13) Hata ka Maliki ng'amwonile bae Yesu kwa nenge tsake mwenyegho, iwanu wasomile wotoghola ghendo ka Maliki kandika pfinu pfayalongelighwe na Petiri na apfo pfiwa mwanduso wa aghala ghandike. Mna chitabu chino Maliki kokomangitsa ukuwatenda iwanu wawe iwanang'ina wa Yesu na malangulitso gha Yesu ahala aghomala ghamatsuwa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-13, Maliki kolonga chitabu chake chilitsa.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:14-8-21, Maliki kolonga sang'ano tsa Yesu hayang'ali ka Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 8:22-10-52, Kuya kolonga ghumwanza ghwa Yesu wa kughenda Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 11:1-16-8, Maliki komalitsa kwa kulonga. ghamatsuwa gha Yesu ako Yelusalemu, pfayafile na pfayatsilihuke.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohane Mbatitsa kowapetela iwanu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohn 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Haino Imbuli Inoghile ya Yesu Kiristu, Imwana we Imulungu.<verse eid="MRK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Yakwandusa ka pfayandikighwe mne chitabu cha nabii Isaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Imulungu kalonga, ‘Nitsomtuma imtumighwa wangu yakulongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">ayo katsoyandaa inzila yako.’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Litsi lye imunu lyokema kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Muyandae inzila ye Imtwatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">muigholose inzila yake.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohane tsakalawila kunyika, kowapetela iwanu na kowabatitsa. Kawalongela iwanu, “Mtsileke nzambi tsenu namwe mbatitsighwe, na Imulungu katsowaleghusila nzambi tsenu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Iwanu wengi walawa mne isi ya Yudeya na mne ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu waghenda kumuhulikitsa Yohane. Watsitoghola nzambi tsawo, naye kawabatitsa mne ghumto Yoridani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohane tsakapfala lighwanda ilitendighwe kwa ngotsi ya ingamiya, na ghumsipi ghwe ngotsi mchuno, na chijo chake chayang'ali yakuja tsachikala iwanzighe na uki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Kawalongela iwanu, “Kuchughu kwangu kakutsa yane ingupfu kubita nene. Nene sibamighwa bae hata kwinama na kudohola mitsabi ye imikwabatsa yake. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nene nowabatitsa mwemwe kwa ghamatsi, lekeni ayo katsowabatitseni kwa Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatitsighwa na kughetsighwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mat 3:13–4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3:21-22</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Ghamatsuwa agho, Yesu tsakatsa kulawa ghumji ghwa Natsareti, mne isi ya Galilaya, kabatitsighwa na Yohane mne ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu hayang'ali yolawa mne ghamatsi, tsakona ililanga lopfughuka na Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka komhulumkila ka injiwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Kuya Iitsi lilawa kulanga, “Ghweghwe kwa imwanangu yanikunoghele, ninoghelighwa naghwe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Bahala Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kamlongotsa yaghende kunyika, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />kuya kakala ako ghamatsuwa arubaini koghetsighwa na Setani. Iwanyama wa kwibagho nawo tsawabahala, na iwamalaika wamtumikila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema iwanang'ina wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Yohane hekighwe mchifungo, Yesu kaghenda Galilaya kuwapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile ye Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Kalonga, “Ichipindi chitsa, Undewa we Imulungu wa habehi. Mtsileke nzambi tsenu muitoghole Imbuli Inoghile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Yesu hayang'ali yoghenda mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu Galilaya, kawona iwalowa wasomba weli, Simoni na Andereya, ndughu yake. Tsawang'ali wolowa iwasomba.<figure style="fig" file="07 Fishing.jpg" size="col" ref="1:16">8. Imunu kolowa kwa nyapfu</figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mniwinze, nani nitsowatenda mwemwe muwe iwalowa iwanu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Bahala watsileka nyapfu tsawo, wamuwinza.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Kaghenda hatali chidogho, kawona Jakobu na Yohane, iwana wa Sebedayo, wamne mnumbwi ghwawo, wotenda ghoya nyapfu tsawo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Bahala Yesu hayawonile, kawakema. Nawo wamleka Sebedayo, aba wawo mne mnumbwi hamwe ne iwatenda isang'ano, wamuwinza.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlapfa imunu chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wapfika mne ghumji ghwa Kaperinaumu. Litsuwa lya Sabato, mana yake litsuwa lyayalaghitse Imulungu iwanu wabwihile. Yesu kengila mne ing'anda ye ukulombela, kandusa kulangulitsa. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Iwanu iwamhulikitse wakangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake, kwaapfila yeye ng'alangulitse bae ka iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa, ila kalangulitsa ka imunu yane ukulu.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Bahala imunu yane ichinyamkela kengila mne ing'anda ye ukulombela kakemelela kwa litsi likulu, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Ubama kutenda choni, Yesu wa Natsareti? Kutsa kutukoma? Nokumanya ghweghwe kwa Mwenzeluka we Imulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu kamkembela ichinyamkela, “Nyamale! Umlawe imunu yuno!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ichinyamkela ayo tsakamhighitsa kwe ingupfu imunu ayo, kuya kakemelela, kamlawa. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Apfo iwanu wose wakangawala ghendo, weghutsa, “Apfino pfinu pfachi? Agha malangulitso gha sambi? Imunu yuno kana uwetso wa kulapfa ipfinyamkela, nawo womtegheletsa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Apfo mbuli tsa Yesu tsenela himahima mne isi yose ya Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwanu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake, hamwe na Jakobu na Yohane walawa mne ing'anda ye ukulombela waghenda ukaye kwa Simoni na Andereya. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Mai mkwe wa Simoni tsakakala kawasa mlusatsi koghula lihoma. Yesu hayapfikile, wamlongela mbuli tse ipinga ayo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Kamghendela, kamkinda ghumoko kamwinula. Utamu umlawa, kandusa kuwatumikila.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Mihe haipfikile na litsua kuswa, iwanu wamghalila Yesu iwatamu wose ne iwanu wane ipfinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Iwanu wose wa ghumji wetingana hachibwalu he ing'anda. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu kawahonetsa iwanu wane matamu ghoghose na kalapfa ipfinyamkela wengi. Ng'aweng'ile bae ipfinyamkela nyafwasi ye ukulonga chochose kwaapfila tsawammanya yeye nani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela iwanu mne isi ya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Lupfilipfili, litsua ng'ana lilawe, Yesu kenuka, kalawa aho hakaye, kaghenda kunze kwe ghumji, hanu halihela imunu, kamlomba Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na weyaghe waghenda kumbama. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Hawamwonile, wamlongela, “Iwanu wose wokubama ghweghwe.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu kawedika, “Twobamighwa tughende kune ipfijiji pfingi ipfili habehi. Amo nobamighwa niwapetele iwanu Imbuli Inoghile, kwaapfila acho chicho chanitsilile.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Apfo Yesu kanga isi yose ya Galilaya, aku kowapetela iwanu mne tsing'anda tsawo tse ukulombela na kulapfa ipfinyamkela.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu iyoghula ukoma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Imunu yumwe iyoghula ukoma tsakamghendela Yesu. Kamtowela ghamaghoti kamlomba, kalonga, “Ung'abama, kwodaha kunideghetesa.” Ukoma tsaukala utamu iumghoma imunu kumlomba Imulungu, kwaapfila imunu yane utamu awo tsakakala keha.<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu kamwonela libatsi imunu ayo, kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kamkinda. Kuya kalonga, “Nobama, degheta!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Bahala utamu umlawa, kahona.<verse eid="MRK 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Bahala Yesu kamleka yoke aku komkomangitsa ghendo, kamlongela, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“Uleke kumlongela imunu wowose imbuli ino, ila ughende wikelanguse kwe mtambika, ulapfe nambiko ka pfayalaghitse Musa. Kuya yakulanguse kwe iwanu ka kuhona.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Lekeni imunu ayo koka, kandusa kwenetsa mbuli atso chila hanu, mbaka Yesu ng'adahile bae kughenda mwatsimwatsi mne ghumji. Ila kakala kunze hanu halihela imunu. Lekeni iwanu tsawang'ali womghendela kulawa chila hanu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu iyaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Ghamatsuwa chidogho hambele, Yesu koya keli Kaperinaumu, na mbuli tsenela kwe iwanu ka tsaka ukaye. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Iwanu wengi wetingana hamwe mbaka kukala kuduhu hokukala, wamema mbaka mne chibwalu. Yesu yang'ali yowapetela imbuli yake. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Baho iwanu wane wapfika, wambapa imunu iyaholole wamghalila Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kwaapfila iwanu tsa wengi, ng'awadahile bae kumghala habehi na Yesu. Apfo watobola mchiswili, kuchanya mwe hanu hayakalile Yesu. Baho, wamhulumsa imunu ayo iyawasile mchilagho. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu honile ukutoghola kwawo, kamlongela imunu ayo iyaholole, “Mwanangu, nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Wangi we iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa iwakalile baho weghutsa mne imimoyo yawo, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Angu ichinu chachi ichimtenda alonge pfino? Komligha Imulungu. Imulungu yaliyeka iyo iyodaha kuleghusa nzambi!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Bahala Yesu kamanya achila chawang'ali wokwalangula mne imimoyo yawo, kawalongela, “Ebali mwakwalangula ipfinu pfino? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Chihi chibewe, kumlongela imunu iyaholole, ‘Nzambi tsako tsileghusighwa,’ au kumlongela, ‘Winuke, usole chilagho chako ughende’? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Nobama mmanye ka Imwana we Imunu kana uwetso wa kuleghusa nzambi muisi.” Baho kamlongela imunu yaholole, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nokulongela, winuke, usole chilagho chako uke ukaye!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Naye kenuka, kasola chilagho chake kaghenda aku iwanu wose womlola. Iwanu wose tsawakangawala, wamtunya Imulungu, walonga, “Ng'ana twone ghendo ichinu ka chino!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu kaghenda keli mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu. Iwanu wamghendela, naye kandusa kuwalangulitsa. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Hang'ali yoluta, kamwona Lawi imwana we Alifayo kakala mne ing'anda ya kulihila kodi. Yesu kamlongela, “Niwinze.” Lawi kenuka, kamuwinza.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Yesu hayang'ali yakuja ichijo cha nemihe mne ing'anda ya Lawi, iwasola kodi wengi na “wane nzambi” tsawakala hasi wang'ali wakuja naye ne wanang'ina wake, kwaapfila tsakukala ne iwanu wengi iwomuwinza. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wamwenga iwakalile Mafarisayo, hawamwonile Yesu kakuja ne “Wane nzambi” ne iwasola kodi, wawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Ebali kakuja ne iwasola kodi na ‘wane nzambi’?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu kawahulika, kawalongela, “Iwanu iwaghima ng'awombama bae imghanga, ila iwatamu iwo iwombama mghanga. Sitsile bae kuwakema iwanu iwanoghile, ila wane nzambi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghutsighwa imbuli ya kufunga ukuja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Iwanafunzi wa Yohane ne iwanang'ina wa Mafarisayo wang'ali wofunga ukuja. Iwanu wangi wamtsila Yesu wamghutsa, “Ebali iwanang'ina wa Yohane ne iwanang'ina wa Mafarisayo wofunga ukuja, lekeni iwanang'ina wako ng'awofunga ukuja bae?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi, iwanu iwakemighwe kune ichihungo cha kukwela wodaha kufunga ukuja aku mmale yokwela kabaho hamwe nawo? Ng'awodaha bae kufunga ukuja. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Lekeni ichipindi chakutsa mmale iyokwela katsosolighwa kulawa kuna wawo, na baho watsofunga ukuja. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Kuduhu imunu iyoghana chilaka mne lighwanda lya sambi na kuchidapfalitsa mne lighwanda lya ghumwande, ang'atenda apfo, chilaka cha sambi chitsolihinya lighwanda lya ghumwande na hanu hadegheke hatsakongetseka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Na kuduhu imunu iyoghuma idipfai ya sambi mne imikoba ye ngotsi ya ghumwande. Ka kotenda apfo, dipfai ya sambi itsoitula imikoba ayo, dipfai itsokwitika ne imikoba itsohinyika. Ila koghuma dipfai ya sambi mne imikoba ya sambi!”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghutsighwa imbuli ya litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Litsuwa limwe lya sabato, Yesu na wanafunzi wake wang'ali wobita mne imighunda ye uhemba. Hawang'ali woghenda, iwanang'ina wake wandusa kukwanyula imikungwi ye uhemba. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafarisayo wamlongela Yesu, “Lola! Ebali wotenda ichinu ichighomighwe mne litsuwa lya Sabato?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu kawedika, “Pfii ng'amsomile bae pfatendile Daudi na wayaghe hawakalile ne nzala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Mne ghamatsuwa ghe Imtambika mkulu Abiyatari, Daudi tsakengila mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, kaja pfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe Imulungu, pfighate apfo tsapfibamighwa pfijighwe ne iwapfilongotsi we inambiko waliyeka. Pfipfila kaweng'a wayaghe.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Litsuwa lya Sabato likighwa kwaajili ye iwanu, na si iwanu bae kwaajili ye Litsuwa lya Sabato.” <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Imwana we Imunu ka Imtwatsa wa Litsuwa lya Sabato.<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu yane ghumoko ighuholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Kuya Yesu kaghenda keli mne ing'anda ye ukulombela. Aho kukala ne imunu yane ghumoko ighuholole. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Iwanu wamwenga wang'ali wobama imbuli ya kumghoghela Yesu. Apfo wamlolesa ka ang'amhonetse imunu ayo mne Litsuwa lya Sabato. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu kamlongela imunu ayo, “Utse hano hambele.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Kuya kawaghutsa iwanu, “Apfi chihi chinoghile cha kutenda mna litsuwa lya Sabato, kutenda ghanoghile au ghehile? Kuukombola ughima au kuukoma?” Lekeni wawo ng'awalongile chinu chochose bae.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Kawalolesa iwanu kwa maya, baho kona usungu mmoyo mwake, kwa usughu we imimoyo yawo. Kuya kamlongela imunu yula, “Ugholose ghumoko ghwako.” Naye kaghugholosa, na ghumoko ghwake ghuhona. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Apfo Mafarisayo walawa kunze mwe ing'anda ye Imulungu, wetingana ne iwanu wa Herodi wandusa kubama inzila ya kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likingili lyomuwinza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghenda kune ghumto Galilaya na iwanu wengi tsawamuwinza, walawila Galilaya na Yudeya. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Hawahulike ghose ghatendile, iwanu wengi wamtsila kulawa Yudeya, Yerusalemu, Idumeya ne ipfijiji ipfili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani ne imiji ya Tiro na Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kwaapfila iwanu wakala wengi, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake wamwikile ghoya mnumbwi, ili iwanu waleke kumsoghelela. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kwaapfila tsakawahonetsa iwanu wengi, iwatamu wose wang'ali womsoghelela habehi wamkinde. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ne iwanu wane ipfinyamkela chila hawamwonile, waghwa hasi hambele hake, wakemelela, “Ghweghwe kwa Imwana we Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Yesu kawaghoma ipfinyamkela waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ka yeye tsanani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosaghula iwanang'ina kumi na weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu kagheluka kuchidunda, kawakema awala iyawabamile mwenyegho, nawo wamghendela. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Naye kawasaghula iwanu kumi na weli, kawakema watumighwa. Kawalongela, “Niwasaghula mwemwe mkale na nene. Kuya nitsowatuma mghende mkawapetele iwanu. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Namwe mtsakuwa na ukulu wa kulapfa ipfinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Awano iwo iwanu kumi na weli iyawasaghule. Simoni, yakemighwe na Yesu taghwa lingi Petiri, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jakobu na ndughu yake Yohane, iwana wa Sebedayo Yesu tsakaweng'a taghwa Boanerige, mana yake iwana wa mdumo, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andereya na Filipi, na Batalomeyo, na Matei, na Tomasi, na Jakobu imwana wa Alifayo, na Tadei, na Simoni Mkananayo, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda Isikarioti, iyamhunduke Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Belisebuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Kuya Yesu kaghenda ukaye, iwanu wengi wetingana keli mbaka Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake ng'awadahile bae ukuja. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Wandughu tsake hawahulike agho, waghenda kumsola kwaapfila tsawalonga, “Kana lukwale.”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso gha Musa iwalawile Yerusalemu walonga, “Kana Belisebuli! Imkulu we ipfinyamkela iyo iyomwing'a ingupfu ya kulapfa ipfinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesu kawakema, kawalongela kwa imifano, “Apfi Setani kodahatse kumlapfa Setani? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Undewa wowose ung'eghola wenyegho, ambe wakughwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Ka ing'anda yeghola yenyegho, ing'anda ayo itsakughwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Apfo ka undewa wa Setani weghola iwenyegho, utsakughwa na kutsigha.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Kuduhu imunu iyodaha kwingila mng'anda mwe imunu yane ingupfu na kusola ipfinu pfake, mbaka tanu amwohe imunu ayo. Baho katsodaha kupfisola ipfinu pfake.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu watsoleghusighwa nzambi tsawo na ghamaligho ghawo ghose kwe Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Lekeni imunu wowose iyomligha Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu ng'odaha bae kuleghusighwa nzambi ayo, kwaapfila katenda nzambi ya ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu tsakalonga apfi kwaapfila iwanu wang'ali wolonga, “Kana chinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mai wake Yesu ne iwandughu tsake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Kuya mai wake Yesu ne iwandughu tsake wapfika. Wema kunze, wamtuma imunu mng'anda amkeme. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Iwanu tsawamtsunguluka Yesu. Nawo wamlongela, “Mai wako na ndughu tsako wakunze, wokubama ghweghwe.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi mai wangu nani na ndughu tsangu tsina nani?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Kuya kawalola iwanu iwamtsunguluke, kalonga “Awano hano iwo mai wangu na ndughu tsangu! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Imunu wowose iyotenda aghala ghobama Imulungu, ayo iyo ndughu yangu na lumbu wangu na mai wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imunu iyohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu kandusa keli kulangulitsa mmbalimbali mwa tsimbu lya Galilaya. Iwanu wengi iwetingane wamtsunguluka mbaka kengila mne mnumbwi na kukala amo. Ne iwanu wose wakala mmbalimbali mwe tsimbu. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Tsakawalangulitsa ipfinu pfingi kwe imifano, na mne ghamalangulitso ghake kawalongela.<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mtegheletse, Imunu iyohanda tsimbeghu tsakaghenda kumitsa tsimbeghu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Hang'ali yomitsa, tsimbeghu tsimwenga tsilaghalila mnzila, pfideghe watsa, watsija. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Tsingi tsilaghalila mne ghamabwe ghane lidongo chidogho. Tsimbeghu tsota himahima, kwaapfila lidongo tsachidogho. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Litsua halilawile, liilakatsa imimeya kwaapfila imitsisi ng'aighendese hasi bae. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Tsimbeghu tsingi tsilaghalila mne tsimiwa, tsikula na tsihinyighwa na tsimiwa, apfo ng'atseleke bae. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Lekeni tsimbeghu tsingi tsilaghalila mne lidongo linoghile. Imimeya yota, ikula na yeleka tsimbeghu, ingi makumi madatu, ingi makumi sita ne ingi miya imwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Kuya Yesu kalonga, “Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, yahulike.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mana ye imbuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu hayakalile aliyeka, iwanang'ina kumi na weli ne iwanu wangi wamghutsa imbuli ayo ilonga choni. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwing'ighwa imbuli ifisighwe ya Undewa we Imulungu. Lekeni awala iwali kunze, wohulika ipfinu kwe imifano <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Walole, lekeni waleke kwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">wahulike, lekeni waleke kumanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">wang'amanyile, wang'oyile kwe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">naye yang'awaleghusila nzambi tsawo.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli ye imunu yohanda ilongatse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi mwemwe ng'ammanyile bae mbuli ino? Lelo mtsomanyatse imbuli yoyose? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Imunu iyohanda kohanda Imbuli ye Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mnzila. Hawohulika Imbuli ye Imulungu, Setani kakutsa na kuisola imbuli ihandighwe mghati mwawo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne ghamabwe. Baho hawohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, woibokela kwa kudeng'elela. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Lekeni kwaapfila wahela imitsitsi, wodudumila chidogho. Ukughaya au ukughanzika kung'alawila kwaajili ye imbuli ye Imulungu, baho woileka. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne tsimiwa. Wohulika imbuli, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />lekeni Sang'ano tse isi ino na kubama tsimali na kusulukila ipfinu pfingi, pfakwingila mghati mwawo na kuihinya imbuli ye Imulungu, ng'aikweleka bae. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Lekeni iwanu wangi weghala na tsimbeghu itsilaghalile mne lidongo linoghile. Wohulika imbuli ye Imulungu, woitoghola na wakweleka, wangi selasini, wangi sitini, na wangi miya imwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitasa ichighubikighwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Apfi kuna imunu iyoghala chitasa mng'anda na kuchighubika ne ichiha au kuchika kumpfungu mwe lusatsi? Apfi ng'ochika hanu ha kwikila chitasa, bae? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Kwaapfila ichinu chochose ichipfisighwe chitsakoneka, ne ichinu chochose ichighubikighwe chitsoghubulighwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika, yahulike.”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Pfipfila kawalongela, “Mtegheletse ghoya chamuhulika! Ghamalaghitso ghamuwahighila iwanu wangi, Imulungu katsowahighila ghamalaghitso ghagho, kuya mtsakongetsighwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kwaapfila imunu yane ichinu katsakongetsighwa ne imunu yalihela ichinu, katsobokighwa hata ichinu chidodo chayenacho.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imbeghu ikota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu kaghendelela kulonga, “Undewa we Imulungu weghala pfino. Imunu kopwililisa tsimbeghu kumghunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Nechilo kowasa, nemisi kameso. Tsimbeghu tsakota na kukula, naye ng'omanya bae ichitendeka. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Lidongo lyenyegho lyotenda imimeya ikule na kweleka, tanu yotula, yolapfa imbelewele, kuya yakweleka. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Uhemba hauwela, imunu ayo kosenga kwa sengo yake, kwaapfila ichipindi cha kupfuna chipfika.”<figure style="fig" file="12 Sickle.jpg" size="col" ref="4:29">Imunu kopfuna kwa sengo yake</figure><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye imbeghu ya haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu kalonga keli, “Apfi Undewa we Imulungu weghala ne ichinu chachi? Apfi tutsolonga kwe imbuli yachi? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Weghala ne imbeghu ya haladali, imbeghu ndodo kubita tsimbeghu tsose itsihandighwa mne isi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Lekeni ing'ahandighwa, yokula na yakuwa mmeya mkulu kubita imimeya yose mne mghunda, nayo yakuwa na ghamaputila makulu ng'ani mbaka wapfideghe wodaha kutsenga ipfibali mne ghamaputila ghake.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu kawapetela iwanu imbuli yake kwa mbuli nyingi itsighalile na tsino, kawalongela ka pfawadahile kuhulika. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ng'alongile nawo bae ichinu chochose bila ye imbuli. Lekeni hawakalile ne iwanang'ina wake waliyeka, kawalongela chila ichinu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koikembela inyahemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Litsuwa alyo nemihe, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Tuloke kumwambu kwa tsimbu.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Tsawawaleka iwanu, iwanang'ina wengila mne mnumbwi mwakalile Yesu, wamsola woka naye. Pfipfila tsakukala na minumbwi ingi. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Inyahemu ilawila na ghamawimbi ghautowa mnumbwi mbaka ghwandusa kumema ghamatsi.<figure style="fig" file="09 Boat in Storm.jpg" size="col" ref="4:37">Inyahemu youtowa mnumbwi</figure> <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu tsakakala kuchughu kwa mnumbwi kawasila ghumto. Iwanang'ina wake wamlamsa, wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, apfi ng'aukona usungu bae, ka twetwe twotsama?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu kalamka, kalikembela libeho na kaghalongela ghamawimbi, “Nyamala,” kuya libeho linyamala na kukala kutindiwala.<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Ule mpfuka? Pfii, mng'ali ng'amtoghola bae?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Nawo wapfuka ghendo, weghutsa, “Ayu munu wachi, libeho na ghamawimbi ghose ghomhulikitsa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa Imunu yane ipfinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wapfika kumwambu kwa tsimbu Galilaya mne isi ya Gerasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Baho Yesu hayalawile mne mnumbwi, ketingana ne imunu yane ichinyamkela yalawile kune tsikaburi. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Imunu ayo tsakakala kune tsikaburi na kuduhu imunu yadahile kumwoha keli hata kwe iminyororo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Kwaapfila tsakohighwa ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghake, lekeni tsakadumla iminyororo na kubena tsimingu itsili mmaghulu mwake. Na kuduhu imunu yane ingupfu yadahile kumghogha. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Imisi ne ichilo tsayang'ali yakwanga mne tsikaburi na mpfidunda, aku kokemelela na kwighanaghana kwa ghamabwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Hayamwonile Yesu kwa kutali, kamtsumila, kamtowela maghoti hambele hake. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Kalila kwa litsi likulu, kalonga, “Yesu Imwana we Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani ubama choni kuna nene? Kwa taghwa lye Imulungu, nokulomba uleke kunidununza!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kalonga apfo kwaapfila Yesu tsakamlongela, “Chinyamkela, lawa mne imunu yuno!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Kuya Yesu kamghutsa, “Taghwa lyako nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Naye kamwidika “Taghwa lyangu Kingili, mana twawengi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Kuya kamlomba Yesu aleke kuwawinga kunze kwe isi ila pfinyamkela awo.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Tsakukala na kingili kulu lye iwangubi wakuja habehi na chidunda. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Apfo ipfinyamkela wamlomba Yesu, “Utughale kune iwangubi, utulekelele twingile mna wawo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu kawalekelela, ne ipfinyamkela awo wamlawa imunu ayo na kwingila mne iwangubi. Likingili lyose lye iwangubi 2,000 watsumila kune tsimbu na kutsama mne ghamatsi.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Iwadimi we iwangubi watsuma na kuwalongela iwanu mne ghumji na mne imighunda. Ne iwanu waghenda kulola achila ichilawile. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Hawapfikile kwa Yesu, wamwona imunu yula yakalile na likingili lye ipfinyamkela kakala hasi, kapfala ghamaghwanda ghake na tsimbutsi tsake tsimuyila, iwanu wose wapfuka. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ne iwanu iwonile ichinu acho wawalongela iwanu ichinu ichimlawile imunu ayo ne iwangubi.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Kuya iwanu wamlomba Yesu yoke mne ghumji ghwawo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yesu hayakalile kodina mne mnumbwi, imunu iyakalile ne ipfinyamkela kamlomba Yesu woke wose.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Lekeni Yesu kalema, kamlongela, “Ghenda ukaye kune iwandughu tsako na uwalongele pfakutendele Imtwatsa na pfakwonele libatsi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Apfo imunu ayo koka Dekapoli kuwalongela achila Yesu chamtendele. Ne iwanu wose iwahulike tsawakangawala.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imwana ipinga wa Yairo ne ipinga iyakindile lighwanda lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu hayalokile keli kumwambu kwe tsimbu, likingili lye iwanu litingana na limtsunguluka aho hambalimbali ha tsimbu. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Kuya imkulu yumwe we ing'anda ya ukulombela iyakemighwe Yairo tsakatsa, hayamwonile Yesu, keghwisa mmaghulu mwake, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />kamlomba “Imwanangu mdodo pinga koghula ng'ani. Nokulomba utse, umwikile ghamoko ghako ahone na yawe mghima.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Apfo Yesu kaghenda naye. Na likingili lye iwanu limuwinza na kumkunughitsa kunughitsa.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Baho tsakukala ne ipinga yumwe yane utamu we kulawa idamu kwa miyaka kumi na mili. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Ipinga ayo tsakadununzika ghendo kughenda kwe iwaghanga na kaghisa ipfinu pfake pfose, lekeni ng'apatile ng'apfu bae na kaghendelela kughula. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Ipinga ayo hayahulike mbuli tsa Yesu, kabita mne likingili, kamghendela Yesu kwa kuchughu na kukinda ghwanda lyake, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />na kelongela imwenyegho “Ning'akinda ghwanda lyake nitsohona.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Hayakindile lighwanda lyake, bahala idamu ileka kumlawa, naye kamanya mne lukuli lwake ka utamu wake uhona. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Bahala Yesu kamanya ingupfu imlawa, apfo kahunduka mne kingili na kughutsa, “Apfi imunu wachi yakindile lighwanda lyangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Iwanang'ina wake wamwidika “Kwakona iwanu pfawokukunughitsa kunughitsa, kuya kwotughutsa ‘Apfi imunu wachi yanikindile?’ ”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Lekeni Yesu kaghendelela kulolesa yamwone imunu wachi iyatendile ichinu acho. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ipinga ayo kamanya ichinu ichimlawile, apfo kamghendela, kodedema kwa kupfuka na kamghwila mmaghulu mwake, kuya kamlongela ghose. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu kamlongela “Imwanangu, ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa. Ughende tseghamba na utamu wako uhone.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu hayang'ali yolonga apfo, iwanu wangi watsa kulawa mne ing'anda ya Yairo, imkulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela wamlongela, “Imwanagho ma kafa, ebali kwoghendela kumdesa imlangulitsi?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yesu hayahulike ichinu chawalongile, kabetsa, kamlongela imkulu we ing'anda ya ukulombela, “Leka kupfuka, ghweghwe toghola.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Kuya Yesu ng'abamile bae imunu wowose amuwinze, ila kaghenda na Petiri, Jakobu na Yohane, ndughu yake Jakobu. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Hawapfikile mne ing'anda ya Yairo, Yesu tsakona tsogho na kahulika iwanu wolila. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yesu kengila mng'anda kawalongela, “Ebali mwotenda tsogho na kulila? Imwana ng'afile bae ila kawasa.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Lekeni wamseka, apfo kawalapfa kunze, kawasola aba na mai wa imwana ayo ne iwanang'ina wake iyakalile nawo, wengila mne chiheleto chawasile imwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Kamkinda ghumoko kamlongela “Talita kumi,” mana yake, “Mwana mdodo pinga, nokulongela lamka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Bahala imwana kenuka na kandusa kughenda (imwana ayo tsakakala na miyaka kumi na mili). Ichinu achi hachilawile, iwanu wakangawala ghendo. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesu kawakanya ghendo waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ichinu ichilawile, kuya kawalongela wamwing'e imwana yula ichijo yaje.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemighwa ako Natsareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu kalawa hanu aho kaghenda kune ghumji ghwake ne iwanang'ina wake wamuwinza. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Mne litsuwa lya Sabato, kandusa kulangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye ukulombela, iwanu wengi iwamhulikitse wakangawala. Waghutsa, “Angu aghapatile kwani agha ghose? Ne ihekima yachi yeng'ighwe yuno mbaka atende ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa?” <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ayuno si yula msongola mibiki bae imwanaghe Mariya, ne iwandughu tsake tsina Jakobu, Yosefu, Yuda na Simoni, na lumbu tsake ng'awalibaha bae na twetwe? Apfo wamlema.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu kawalongela, “Manabii wohulikitsighwa chila hanu, ila ng'awohulikitsighwa bae mne imiji yawo na mghati mwa iwandughu tsawo, na mkaye mwawo iwenyegho.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yesu ng'adahile bae kutenda pfinu pfa kukangawatsa ako, ila kawekila ghamoko iwatamu chidogho, kawahonetsa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu tsakakangawala ng'ani kwa ukulema kwawo kutoghola.<verse eid="MRK 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatuma iwanang'ina kumi na weli.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Kuya Yesu kanga mne ipfijiji apfila kuwalangulitsa iwanu. Kawakema hamwe iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, kawatuma weliweli na kaweng'a ukulu wa kuwalapfa ipfinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Kuya kawalongela, “Mleke kusola ichinu chochose kwaajili ya ghumwanza, ila ing'weku iliyeka. Mleke kusola pfighate, imikoba ya ghamaghwanda wala sendi. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mpfale imikwabatsa, mleke kughala lighwanda lingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ing'anda yoyose yamtsakwingila, mkale baho mbaka hamtsakuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Na hanu hohose iwanu hawolema kuwabokela au kuwategheletsa, mlawe hanu aho na mkung'use litimbwisi mmaghulu mwenu ka ukalangama kuna wawo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Apfo tsawoka na kuwapetela iwanu watsileke nzambi tsawo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Tsawalapfa ipfinyamkela wengi na kuwabaka ghamafuta iwatamu wengi, wawahonetsa.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yohane Mbatitsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Imndewa Herodi kahulika mbuli atso, kwaapfila taghwa lya Yesu tsalimanyika chila hanu. Iwanu wangi walonga, “Yohane Mbatitsa katsilihuka. Ndo mana kana ngupfu tsa ukutenda ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Lekeni wangi walonga, “Ayuno Eliya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Na wangi walonga, “Ayuno nabii ka wala manabii wa ghumwande.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Herodi hayahulike apfo, kalonga, “Yohane iyanimghanile litwi katsilihuka!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Kwaapfila Herodi imwenyegho tsakalaghitsa Yohane yaghoghighwe, yekighwe mne chifungo. Tsakatenda apfo kwaajili ya Herodiya mwehe wake, ipinga ayo tsakakala mwehe wa ndughu yake Filipi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yohane Mbatitsa tsakaghendelela kumlongela Herodi, “Ng'apfinoghile bae ghweghwe kumkwela mwehe wa ndughu yako.” <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Naye Herodiya tsakamhila Yohane na kabama amkome. Lekeni ng'adahile bae kwaajili ya Herodi. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Herodi tsakampfuka Yohane kwaapfila kamanya Yohane kakala imunu yanoghile na yenzeluke, apfo yang'ali yomlolesa. Tsayang'ali yonoghela kumhulikitsa, hata ka tsayang'ali yoghanzika ng'ani hayomalitsa kumhulikitsa.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Litsuwa limwe, Herodiya tsakapata nafasi mne ichihungo cha kwelekighwa kwa Herodi. Herodi tsakawatendela ichihungo iwatawala, iwakulu we asikali na ipfilongotsi we isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Neghe Herodiya hayengile tsakapfina, kamdeng'elesa Herodi ne iwahenza wake. Apfo imndewa kamlongela imwana ayo, “Unilombe ichinu chochose chaubama, nitsokwing'a.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kelaha, “Nitsokwing'a chochose chaubama, hata ka inusu ya undewa wangu!”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Kuya imwana ayo kaghenda kumghutsa mai wake, “Nilombe choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Naye kamwidika, “Lomba litwi lya Yohane Mbatitsa.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Imwana ayo katsuma mbaka kwa imndewa kamlomba, “Nobama ungaye litwi lya Yohane Mbatitsa mne lungo!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Imndewa kona usungu ng'ani, lekeni ng'adahile bae kulema, kwaapfila tsakelaha hambele he iwahenza wake. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Bahala imndewa kamlaghitsa asikali, kamlongela aghale litwi lya Yohane. Asikali kaghenda mne chifungo, kamghana litwi Yohane. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Kuya kaghala litwi alyo mne lungo, kamwing'a imwana ayo. Naye kamwing'a mai wake. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Iwanang'ina wa Yohane hawahulike apfi, waghenda kulusola lukuli lwake, walutsika.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'a ichijo iwanu 5,000.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohn 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Iwatumighwa woya na wetingana kwa Yesu, wamlongela aghala ghose ghawatendile na kulangulitsa. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Yesu kawalongela, “Leka tughende tuliyeka hanu halihela imunu tukabwihile.” Kalonga apfo kwaapfila tsakukala ne iwanu wengi iwang'ali wakutsa na ukuka, mbaka Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake ng'awadahile bae kupata nafasi ya ukuja ichijo. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Apfo woka waliyeka mne mnumbwi, waghenda hanu halihela imunu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Lekeni iwanu iwawonile hawang'ali wakuka, tsawamanya. Apfo watsuma kwa mghulu kulawa mne imiji yose, kuya walongola kupfika. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu hayalawile mne mnumbwi, kona mtingano mkulu ghwe iwanu, kawonela libatsi kwaapfila tsawoneka ka iwang'olo iwalihela mdimi. Apfo kandusa kuwalangulitsa ipfinu pfingi.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Mihe haipfikile, iwanang'ina wake wamghendela wamlongela, “Hanu hano hana nyika iliyeka, na litsua liswa. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Waleke woke kune imighunda ne ipfijiji, ili wakeghulile ichijo iwenyegho.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Lekeni kawedika, “Mwemwe muweng'e ichijo waje.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Wamghutsa, “Apfi kwotubama tughende tukawaghulile pfighate pfa sendi miya mbili tuweng'e waje?” <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Kawaghutsa, “Mna pfighate pfingapi? Mghende mkalole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Hawamanyile, wamlongela “Kuna pfighate pfitano ne iwasomba weli.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, wawalongele iwanu wose weghole mne makingili, wakale hasi mne mitsani imibisi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Apfo wakala mne makingili ghe iwanu, hano miya, hano hamsini. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Kuya Yesu kasola pfighate pfila pfitano ne iwasomba weli, kalola kulanga, kapfibaliki kuya kapfibena pfighate pfila. Kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu. Pfipfila kawagholela iwanu wose iwasomba wala weli. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Iwanu wose waja weghuta, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />ne iwanang'ina wake wadondola pfighate ne iwasomba yawakalile wamemetsa pfiseghe kumi na pfili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Iwamale iwajile wakala elufu tano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mchanya mwa ghamatsi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohn 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Bahala Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake wengile mne mnumbwi wamlongolele kughenda Betisaida. Yeye tsayang'ali kowaagha iwanu woke. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Hayamalitse kuwaagha iwanu, kaghenda mlughongo kulomba. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Mihe haipfikile, mnumbwi ghukala mghati mwe tsimbu naye kakala aliyeka kunze kwe tsimbu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Tsakawona iwanang'ina wake woghaya mne mnumbwi, kwaapfila libeho ling'ali lyowatowa kwa ingupfu. Habehi na kucha, kawaghendela, yang'ali yoghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi. Kabama awalute, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />nawo hawamwonile koghenda mchanya mwe ghamatsi, tsawepfikitsa tsakakala mtsimu. Walila kwa litsi likulu, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />kwaapfila wose tsawamwona na wang'ali wopfuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Bahala Yesu kawalongela, “Nene! Mleke kupfuka.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Kuya kengila mne mnumbwi hamwe nawo, na libeho linyamala, iwanang'ina wake wakangawala ghendo. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Kwaapfila ng'awamanyile bae mbuli tsa pfighate, imimoyo yawo tsaikala mikomu.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonetsa iwatamu ako Genesareti.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Waloka tsimbu, wapfika mne isi ya Genesareti, baho wemitsa imnumbwi ghwawo. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Hawalawile mne mnumbwi, bahala iwanu wamtanga Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Apfo watsuma mne isi yose, wandusa kuwasola iwatamu mne ghamasatsi na kuwaghala hanu hohose kuwahulike Yesu kabaho. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Na chila hanu kwayaghendile, mne ipfijiji, imiji au kumighunda, waweka iwatamu mne ghamasoko. Wamlomba awaleke wakinde hata mindo ya lighwanda lyake, na wose iwamkindile tsawahona.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Ichihile ne ichideghete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Mafarisayo wangi na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso iwalawile Yerusalemu, wetingana hambele ha Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Wawona iwanang'ina wake wamwenga wakuja ichijo bila kwohopfugha ghamoko ghawo.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Mafarisayo na Wayahudi wose ng'awakuja bae ichijo mbaka wahopfughe ghamoko ghawo mbaka mne pfipfughumu, tsawakinda ichihendo cha iwabala wawo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Hawolawa kusoko ng'awakuja ichinu chochose mbaka wachihopfughe. Pfipfila tsawakinda ipfihendo pfingi ka kuhopfugha ipfikombe, ghamabigha na pfiha.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Apfo awala Mafarisayo na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wamghutsa Yesu, “Ebali iwanang'ina wako ng'awokinda bae ipfihendo pfa iwabala, ila wakuja kwa ghamoko ghehile?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu kawedika, “Isaya tsakatabili pfinoghile kuna mwemwe, mwemwe iwang'enye, ka pfandike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Iwanu wano wonihulikitsa kwa imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">lekeni imimoyo yawo yakutali na nene.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Wonitamanila hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">wolangulitsa ghamalaghitso ghe iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">ka ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Mleka ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:8">mwokinda ipfihendo pfe iwanu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Kuya kawalongela, “Pfinogha! Mna inzila inoghile ya kulema ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu ili mkinde ipfihendo pfenu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Musa tsakalonga, ‘Uwahulike aba wako na mai wako,’ na ‘Imunu wowose iyomligha aba wake au mai wake katsokufa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Lekeni mwemwe mwolangulitsa, ka imunu kana ichinu cha kumwapfila aba wake au mai wake lekeni kolonga, ‘Ichinu achi Koribani’ mana yake, nzawadi kwe Imulungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />apfo ng'obamighwa keli kumwapfila aba wake au mai wake. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Apfo mwoibetsa imbuli ye Imulungu kwe ipfihendo pfenu pfambokele. Na mwotenda ipfinu pfingi ka apfo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipfinu ipfimtenda imunu yehe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kuya Yesu kalikema keli kingili lila lye iwanu, kawalongela, “Mnitegheletse mwemwe wose, mmanye. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Kuduhu ichinu ichikwingila mghati mwe imunu kulawa kunze ichidaha kumtenda yehe. Lekeni ichilawa mghati mwe imunu, acho chomtenda imunu yehe. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Imunu yane ghamaghutwi gha kuhulika na yahulike.”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Halilekile kingili lye iwanu na kwingila mng'anda, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa mana ye imbuli ayo. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu kawalongela, “Apfi namwe mwahela tsimbutsi? Angu ng'ammanya bae ka kuduhu ichinu ichimwingila imunu kulawa kunze chimtende yehe? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Kwaapfila ng'achimwingila bae mne ghumoyo ila chakwingila munda, kuya cholawa kunze kwe lukuli lwake.” Kwa ukulonga apfi, Yesu kapfitenda ipfijo pfose “pfinogha.”<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Kaghendelela kulonga, “Ichinu ichimlawa imunu, acho chomtenda yehe. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kwaapfila mne ghumoyo ghwe imunu, gholawa mawatso ghehile, utsinzi, ubapfi, ukukoma, dong'o, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />ughoni, ughutsu, ufisadi, chepfu, maligho, kwighoda, chidandali ne ubotsi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Agho ghose ghehile gholawa mghati mwe imunu, nagho ghomtenda imunu yehe.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutoghola kwe ipinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu kalawa hanu aho, kaghenda mne ghumji ghwa Tiro. Ako kengila mne ing'anda na ng'abamile bae imunu wowose amanye, lekeni ng'adahile bae kwipfisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ipinga yumwe iyakalile ne imwana pinga yane ichinyamkela, kahulika mbuli tsa Yesu. Apfo kamghendela, kamghwila mmaghulu mwake. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Ipinga ayo tsakakala Mgiriki, iyelekighwe mne ghumji ghwa Sirofoinike. Kamlomba Yesu amlapfe mwanaghe ichinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Tanu waleke iwana weghute. Ng'apfinoghile bae kusola ichijo che iwana na kuwasila wambwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Imtwatsa, lekeni hata wambwa iwali hasi mwe imetsa wakuja ipfijo pfawalekile iwana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu kamlongela ipinga yula, “Kwa apfo pfawidike, uke ukaye, ichinyamkela kamlawa imwanagho.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Apfo ipinga yula koka ukaye, kampfika imwanaghe kawasa mne lusatsi na ichinyamkela kamlawa.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imunu iyali chitsiwi na chibubu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Kuya Yesu koka mne ghumji ghwa Tiro, kaghenda Galilaya kwa kubitila Sidoni na mne ghumji ghwa Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Iwanu wangi wamghalila imunu chitsiwi na iyang'adahile bae ukulonga pfinoghile, wamlomba Yesu amwikile ghamoko imunu ayo. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Apfo Yesu kamseghetsa imunu ayo hambali ne iwanu. Keka pfidole pfake mne ghamaghutwi ghe imunu ayo. Kuya kabwalula ghamate na kaludonza lulimi lwake. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesu kalola kulanga, kahumula kwe ingupfu, kamlongela imunu ayo, “Epfata,” (mana yake, “Ghubuka!”).<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Bahala ghamaghutwi ghe imunu yula ghaghubuka, lulimi lwake luleghela, kandusa kulonga pfinoghile. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Kuya Yesu kawalaghitsa waleke kumlongela imunu wowose. Lekeni ka pfayaghendelele kuwaghoma, waghendelela kulalatsa mbuli ayo. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Iwanu wakangawala ghendo. Walonga, “Katenda ghoya chila ichinu. Hata pfitsiwi kowatenda wahulike, na pfibubu walonge!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kowaghutitsa iwanu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mne ghamatsuwa agho, kingili lingi likulu litingana. Kwaapfila tsawakala wahela ichijo, Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake, kawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nowonela libatsi iwanu wano, kwaapfila wakala na nene kwa ghamatsuwa madatu bila ukuja. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ning'awalongela woke mmakaye mwawo ne inzala, wodaha kutsilika mnzila, kwaapfila wangi wolawa kutali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Apfi hano kunyika imunu kodaha kupata kwani ichijo chokuweng'a iwanu wose wano waghute?”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu kawaghutsa, “Mna pfighate pfingapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Wamwidika, “Saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yesu kawalongela iwanu wakale hasi. Kasola pfighate pfila saba, kapfibaliki, kapfibena na kuweng'a iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu, nawo watenda pfipfo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Pfipfila tsawakala ne iwasomba wadowado chidogho. Yesu kawabaliki pfipfila na kuwalongela iwanang'ina wake waweng'e iwanu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Iwanu waja na kwighuta. Kuya iwanang'ina wake wadondola pfiseghe saba ipfimemile ipfijo ipfisighale. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Iwanu iwajile tsawakala elufu nne. Kuya Yesu kawaagha, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />bahala kengila mne mnumbwi ne iwanang'ina wake, kaghenda mne ghumji ghwa Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mafarisayo wangi wamghendela na wandusa kumghutsa. Wamghetsa, wabama chitango kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Tsakwona usungu mne ghumoyo ghwake, kalonga, “Ebali mweleko ghuno ghwobama ichitango? Nowalongela ghendo, ng'awatsakwing'ighwa ichitango chochose.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Kuya kawaleka, kengila mne mnumbwi, kaloka kaghenda kumwambu.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hamila ya Mafarisayo na Herodi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Iwanang'ina tsawesemwa kughala pfighate, wakala na chighate chimwe chiliyeka mne mnumbwi. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu kawakanya, kawalongela, “Mwalangitse ne hamila ya Mafarisayo na ya Herodi!”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Wandusa kwilongela iwenyegho, “Kalonga apfi kwaapfila twahela chighate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu tsakamanya chawang'ali wolonga. Kawaghutsa, “Ebali mwelongela iwenyegho, kwaapfila mwahela chighate? Mng'ali ng'ammanya au kutanga? Apfi imimoyo yenu mikomu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mna tsinenge ng'amkwona bae, na mna ghamaghutwi ng'amhulika bae? Na ng'amkumbuka bae <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />hanibenile pfighate pfila pfitano na kuweng'a wala iwanu elufu tano? Apfi tsamdondole pfiseghe pfingapi ipfimemile pfihande ipfisighale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Wamlongela, “Kumi na pfili.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Na hanibenile pfighate pfila saba na kuweng'a iwanu elufu nne, apfi mdondole pfiseghe pfingapi ipfimemile pfihande ipfisighale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Wamwidika “Saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Kawaghutsa, “Pfii ng'ana mmanye bae?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ichifita ako Betisaida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Tsawapfika Betisaida, iwanu wangi wamghalila Yesu ichifita, wamlomba amkinde. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Kamkinda ghumoko ichifita yula, kamlapfa kunze kwe chijiji. Kuya kambwalulila ghamate mnenge, kamwikila ghamoko ghake, kamghutsa, “Kwodaha kwona ichinu chochose?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Imunu ayo kalola kuya kalonga, “Nakwona iwanu, wakoneka ka imibiki itsunguluka.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu keka keli ghamoko mne tsinenge tse imunu ayo. Kuya tsinenge tsake tsifughuka, naye kona pfinoghile ipfinu pfose. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu kamlongela aghende ukaye yake na kamghoma kwingila mne ipfijiji na kuwalongela iwanu.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri komtoghola Yesu kuwa Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake waghenda mne ipfijiji pfa Kaisariya Filipi. Mnzila Yesu kawaghutsa, “Apfi iwanu wolonga nene nili nani?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wamwidika, “Wangi wolonga ghweghwe kwa Yohane Mbatitsa, wangi wolonga kwa Eliya na wangi wolonga kwa yumwe wa manabii.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Kuya Yesu kawaghutsa, “Namwe mwolonga nene nili nani?” Petiri kamwidika “Ghweghwe kwa Kiristu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu kawakanya “Mleke kumlongela imunu wowose mbuli tsangu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli ya kudununzika na lifwa lyake.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Kuya kandusa kuwalangulitsa iwanang'ina wake. “Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa adununzike ng'ani na kulemighwa ne iwabala, watambika wakulu, ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Na kobamighwa akomighwe ne atsilihuke mne litsuwa lya kadatu.” <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Tsakawalongela imbuli ayo bila kupfisa, apfo Petiri kamsola Yesu mmbalimbali, kandusa kumkembela. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Lekeni Yesu kahunduka, kawalolesa iwanang'ina wake na kumkembela Petiri, “Soghela hano Setani! Kwaapfila ng'aukwalangula bae mbuli tse Imulungu, ila kokwalangula mbuli tse iwanu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Kuya Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake na kingili lye iwanu kawalongela, “Imunu wowose iyobama kuniwinza, yeleme imwenyegho, asole msalaba ghwake aniwinze.” <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kwaapfila imunu wowose iyobama kuukombola ughima wake, katsowaghisa, ila imunu wowose iyowaghisa ughima wake kwaajili ya nene na kwaajili ye Imbuli Inoghile katsoukombola. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Apfi iwanu wobweda choni ka wopata isi yose lekeni wakwaghisa ughima wawo? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Kuduhu ichinu chawodaha kulapfa waupate keli ughima wawo. <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Imunu ang'ambonela chinyala nene na mbuli tsangu mne iwanu wa mweleko ghuno ghwa nzambi na utsinzi, Imwana we Imunu katsomwonela chinyala hatsakutsa mne utunitso wa Aba wake hamwe ne wamalaika wahenzeluka wa kulanga.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koghaluka chihanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Kaghendelela kulonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu wamwenga iwemile hano ng'awatsakufa bae mbaka wawone Undewa we Imulungu iukutsa kwe ingupfu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Matsuwa sita hambele, Yesu kawasola Petiri, Jakobu na Yohane, kaghenda nawo mchidando hanu halihela imunu. Baho Yesu kaghaluka chihanga, hambele hawo. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Na ghamaghwanda ghake ghawa matselu ng'ani, kuduhu imunu wowose mne isi iyodaha kughatsapfa ghamaghwanda ghawe matselu apfo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kuya Eliya na Musa walawila hambele hawo, walonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petiri kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, pfinogha twetwe tukale hano. Leka tutsenge pfibumbulika pfidatu, chimwe cha kwako, chimwe cha Musa na chimwe che Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ng'amanyile bae cha kulonga, kwaapfila wose tsawang'ali wopfuka ng'ani.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Kuya liwingu lilawila, liwaghubika, na litsi lilawila mne liwingu. “Ayuno imwanangu yanoghele, mumtegheletse!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Bahala hawalolese mmbalimbali ng'awamwonile imunu wowose hamwe nawo, ila Yesu yaliyeka.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Hawakalile wohulumka kulawa mchidando, Yesu kawalaghitsa waleke kumlongela imunu wowose ghawonile, mbaka Imwana we Imunu hatsotsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Watoghola chayalongile, lekeni weghutsa, “Kutsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa mana yake choni?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Kuya wamghutsa Yesu, “Ebali iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wolonga Eliya kobamighwa tanu yatse?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu kawedika, “Ona, tanu Eliya kakutsa kwika chila ichinu pfinoghile. Ebali lelo yandikighwa Imwana we Imunu kobamighwa yadununzike na kulemighwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Lekeni nowalongela, Eliya katsa na wamtendela ghose ghawabamile, ka mbuli tsake pfatsandikighwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa imsongolo yane ichinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Hawawapfikile iwanang'ina wangi, wona mtingano mkulu we iwanu liwatsunguluka ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wehisanya nawo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Bahala iwanu wose hawamwonile Yesu wakangawala ng'ani, wamtsumila kumlamsa. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Apfi mwehisanya nawo choni?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Imunu yumwe mne kingili lye iwanu kamwidika, “Mlangulitsi, nikughalila imwanangu kana ichinyamkela iyamtedile awe chibubu. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Na chila hayomnighula, komghwisa hasi, na imwana kolawa lihofu mne mlomo, koghegheda ghamatsino ghake kuya koghoghodala. Niwalomba iwanang'ina wako wamlapfe ichinyamkela, lekeni ng'awadahile bae.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe lukolo ing'alutoghola! Nikale namwe mbaka tsuwachi? Mnighalile imwana ayo!” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Wamghalila imwana ayo. Ichinyamkela hamwonile Yesu, bahala kamghwisa imwana ayo chisala, imwana kaghwa hasi na kwibulughitsa, kalapfa lihopfu mne mlomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu kamghutsa aba we imwana ayo, “Angu imwana yuno kapfino kulawa tsuwachi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Kamwidika, “Kulawa udodo wake. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Komghwisagha mne ghumoto au mne ghamatsi ili yamkome. Lekeni ka kwodaha kutenda ichinu, utwonele libatsi ne utwapfile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu kalonga, “Ka kwodaha! Ghose ghodahika kwe imunu iyotoghola.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Bahala aba we imwana yula kakemelela kalonga, “Notoghola, ila unyapfile nitoghole ghendo!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu halyonile kingili lye iwanu lyakongetseka hambele hake, kamkembela ichinyamkela ayo, “Ghwe ichinyamkela we ububu ne utsiwi, nokulongela ulawe mne imwana yuno na uleke kumwingila keli!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Ichinyamkela kakemelela, kamghwisa chisala imwana ayo, kamlawa. Na imwana tsakoneka ka kafa, na iwanu wengi walonga, “Kafa!” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Lekeni Yesu kamkinda ghumoko imwana ayo, kamwapfila kwinuka, naye kenuka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu hayengile mng'anda, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa hawakalile naye waliyeka, “Ebali twetwe ng'atudahile bae kumlapfa ichinyamkela yula?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu kawedika, “Ichinyamkela ka yuno ng'odaha bae kulawa kwa inzila yoyose, ila kwa kulomba kuliyeka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga keli imbuli ya ukufa kwake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na iwanang'ina wake woka hanu hala waghenda Galilaya. Yesu ng'abamile bae imunu wowose amanye kwayali, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kwaapfila yang'ali yowalangulitsa iwanang'ina wake. Kawalongela, “Imwana we imunu katsoghelighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwanu, nawo watsomkoma. Ghamatsuwa madatu hambele, katsotsilihuka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Lekeni ng'awaimanyile bae imbuli ayo na wapfuka kumghutsa.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuhi iyali mkulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Hawafikile Kaperinaumu, wengila mng'anda na Yesu kawaghutsa iwanang'ina wake, “Ichinu chachi chamng'ali mwisongela mnzila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Lekeni ng'awamwidike bae, kwaapfila wang'ali wesongela yuhi yali mkulu.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu kakala hasi, kawakema iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, kalonga, “Imunu wowose yobama kuwa wa mwanduso, kobamighwa yawe wa utsighilo, na yawe imtumwa wa wose.”<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Kuya kamsola imwana mdodo, kamwika mghati mwawo, kawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Imunu wowose iyombokela imwana mdodo ka yuno kwa taghwa lyangu, kombokela nene. Ne imunu iyombokela nene, kombokela yula iyanitumile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu wowose iyotutoghola kaubali wetu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yohane kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, tumwona imunu kolapfa ipfinyamkela kwa taghwa lyako. Tumghoma kwaapfila ng'olawila bae mne kingili lyetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mleke kumghoma. Haduhu imunu iyodaha kutenda ipfinzonza kwa taghwa lyangu na baho kulonga mbuli tsangu pfihile. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kwaapfila imunu wowose yali ubali wetu, ayo kamiyetu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose iyoweng'a ichikombe cha ghamatsi kwaapfila mwemwe mwa iwanu wa Kiristu, katsobokela ghweko lyake.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuhonza iwanu wangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Imunu wowose iyowahonza wadodo wano iwonitoghola watende ghehile, ng'apfu imunu ayo yohighwe libwe lya kusaghila msingo mwake na kwasighwa mne ibahali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ka ghumoko ghwako ghwokuhonza utende ghehile, ghughane. Ng'apfu kwingila kune ughima na ghumoko ghumwe, kubita kwingila jehanamu na ghamoko meli. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Ako membele iwowaja ng'awakufa bae, na ghumoto ighuwalakatsa ng'aghutsimika bae. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Ka mghulu ghwako wokuhonza utende ghehile, ghughane. Ng'apfu kwingila kune ughima na mghulu ghumwe, kubita kuwa na ghamaghulu meli na kwasighwa jehanamu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Ako membele iwowaja ng'awakufa bae, na ghumoto ighuwalakatsa ng'aghutsimika bae. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Na ka inenge yako yokuhonza utende ghehile, ing'ole. Ng'apfu kwingila kune Undewa we Imulungu na inenge imwe, kubita kuwa na tsinenge mbili na kwasighwa jehanamu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Ako membele wake ng'awakufa bae, na ghumoto ghwake ng'aghutsimika bae.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Chila imunu katsodeghetetsighwa kwa ghumoto ka inyama pfaighumighwa imunyu.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Imunyu inogha, lekeni ka ihinyika, itsoghumighwa choni mbaka ikolele keli?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Muwe ne imunyu mghati mwenu, na mkale tseghamba.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolangulitsa imbuli ya talaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Kuya Yesu koka hanu hala kaghenda kune chijiji cha Yudeya na kuloka ghumto Yoridani. Kuya kingili lye iwanu limtsila, naye kawalangulitsa ka pfatsowele.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Mafarisayo wangi wamghendela, wamghetsa kwa kumghutsa, “Apfi pfinogha imunu kumleka mwehe wake?” <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu kawedika, “Apfi Musa yalaghitse choni?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Wedika, “Musa kalonga, twodaha kwandika talaka na kuwaleka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu kawalongela, “Musa kandika apfo kwaapfila imimoyo yenu misughu. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Lekeni kulawa mwanduso, ‘Imulungu kalumba mmale ne ipinga.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Apfo, immale katsomleka mai wake na aba wake, naye katselunga na mwehe wake, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />nawo watsokuwa lukuli lumwe na si weli keli bae, ila lukuli lumwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Apfo chayalungile Imulungu, imunu yaleke kuchibaghula.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Hawoyile keli mng'anda, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa Yesu imbuli ayo. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Kawedika, “Imunu wowose iyomleka mwehe wake na kukwela ipinga yungi komtendela utsinzi mwehe wake. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Pfipfila, ipinga yomleka immale wake na kukwelighwa ne immale yungi komtendela utsinzi immale wake.” <verse eid="MRK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Iwanu wamwenga wamghalila Yesu iwana wadowado yawekile ghamoko, lekeni iwanang'ina wake wawakembela. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu honile apfi tsakona usungu, kawalongela, “Muwaleke iwana wadowado watse kuna nene, mleke kuwaghoma kwaapfila Undewa wa Imulungu wa iwana ka wano. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose yolema kuubokela Undewa we Imulungu ka imwana mdodo, ng'atsowingila bae.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kawasola iwana awo, kawekila ghamoko, kawabaliki.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imunu tajiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu hayang'ali yakuka, imunu yumwe kamtsumila, kamtowela maghoti, kamghutsa. “Mlangulitsi yunoghile, nitende ichinu chachi niubokele ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Ebali unikema nene ninogha? Kuduhu imunu yanoghile ila Imulungu yaliyeka. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Kwoghamanya ghamalaghitso. ‘Uleke kukoma, Uleke utsinzi, Uleke ubapfi, Uleke kulonga ughutsu, Uleke ung'enye, Uwahulikitse aba wako na mai wako.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Imunu ayo kamwidika, “Mlangulitsi, agho ghose nighakinda kulawa udodo wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu kamlola, kamnoghela, kamlongela, “Kuhungukighwa na ichinu chimwe, ghenda ukautse pfose pfaulinapfo uweng'e sendi iwahingwa, naghwe kutsakuwa ne utajiri kulanga. Kuya utse uniwinze.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Hayahulike apfo, kaghudubuka koka kwa usungu kwaapfila tsakakala na mali nyingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu kalola mmbalimbali, kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Itsakuwa pfikomu kwe imunu tajiri kwingila mne Undewa we Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Iwanang'ina wake wakangawala hawahulike mbuli atso. Lekeni Yesu kalonga keli, “Iwanangu, itsakuwa pfikomu kwingila mne Undewa wa Imulungu! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Pfikomu kwa imunu tajiri kwingila mne undewa wa Imulungu kubita imnyama yokemighwa ngamiya kwingila mne litobo lya sindano.”<figure style="fig" file="14 Camel.jpg" size="col" ref="10:25">Ngamiya</figure><verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Iwanang'ina wakangawala ghendo, weghutsa, “Lelo yuhi iyodaha kukombolighwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu kawalola, kalonga, “Kwe imunu ng'aidahika bae, lekeni kwe Imulungu si pfipfo bae, ghose ghodahika kwe Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petiri kamlongela, “Tuleka chila chinu tukuwinza ghweghwe!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose yalekile kaye yake au iwandughu tsake au lumbu tsake, aba wake au mai wake au iwanaghe au imighunda kwaajili ya nene ne Imbuli Inoghile, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />katsobokela ketseketse mne ghamatsuwa ghano. Katsobokela kaye, iwandughu, lumbu, mai, iwana, ne imighunda na kudununzika na mne ghamatsuwa ighakutsa katsobokela ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Lekeni awala iwalongole watsakuwa kuchughu ne iwali kuchughu watsolongola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga lwakadatu imbuli ya lifwa lyake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake wang'ali wogheluka woghenda Yerusalemu, Yesu kawalongola, iwanang'ina wake wakangawala ne iwanu iwakalile womuwinza wose wapfuka. Yesu kawasola keli iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli mmbalimbali, kawalongela aghala ighatsomlawila. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Kawalongela, “Mtegheletse, twoghenda Yerusalemu, ako Imwana we Imunu katsakwing'ighwa kwa pfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Nawo watsomuhigha yafe na kwing'ighwa kwa Iwanu si Wayahudi bae. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Watsombetsa, watsombwalulila ghamate, watsomfapula ne ipfiboko, na ghamatsuwa madatu hambele, katsotsilihuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobu na Yohane womlomba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Kuya Jakobu na Yohane, iwana wa Sebedayo wamghendela Yesu, wamlongela, “Mlangulitsi kuna ichinu twobama ututendele twetwe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Kawaghutsa, “Chinu chachi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Wamwidika, hautsokala mne chighoda chako che Undewa mne utunitso wako, twobama tukale naghwe, yumwe ubali wako wa kujilo na yungi ubali wako wa kumoso.<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu kawedika, “Ng'ammanyile bae chamlomba. Apfi mwodaha kunwela ichikombe chanikunwela nene au kubatitsighwa ubatitso wanibatitsighwa nene?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Wamwidika, “Twodaha.” Yesu kawalongela, “Mtsochinwela ichikombe chanikunwela nene na kubatitsighwa ubatitso wanibatitsighwa. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Lekeni imbuli ya kukala ubali wangu wa kujilo au wa kumoso si yangu bae kuweng'a. Hanu aho watsokala awala iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Iwanang'ina wala kumi hawahulike achila chawalombile Jakobu na Yohane wawonela maya. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu kawakema wose hamwe, kawalongela, “Mwomanya awala iwakwoneka iwakulu we iwanu iwali si Wayahudi bae wowatawala kwe ingupfu. Na iwakulu awo wana ukulu kune iwanu. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Lekeni kuna mwemwe ileke kuwa apfo, imunu wowose iyobama kuwa mkulu kuna mwemwe kobamighwa yawe imtumwa, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />imunu wowose iyobama kuwa mkulu kobamighwa yawe imtumwa wa wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kwaapfila Imwana we Imunu, ng'atsile bae kutumikighwa, ila katsa kutumikila na kulapfa ughima wake kwa kuwakombola iwanu wengi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonetsa ichifita Batimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Kuya wapfika Yeriko, Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake hamwe na kingili lye iwanu hawang'ali wakuka mne ghumji, ichifita yumwe iyakemighwe Batimayo imwana wa Timayo kakala mmbalimbali mwe inzila kolomba. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Naye hayahulike Yesu Mnatsareti kobita, kandusa kukemelela, “Yesu, Imwana wa Daudi! Mbonele libatsi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Iwanu wengi wamkembela, wamlongela yenyamale, lekeni kaghendelela kukema, “Imwana wa Daudi, mbonele libatsi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu kema, kalonga, “Mlongeleni yatse.” Apfo wamkema, wamlongela, “Wighangamitse! Winuke kokukema.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Kalyasa lighwanda lyake, kadaluka kamghendela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu kamghutsa, “Kwobama nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Ichifita ayo kamwidika, “Mlangulitsi, nobama kwona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu kamlongela, “Ghenda, ukutoghola kwako kukuhonetsa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Bahala kadaha kwona, kuya kamuwinza Yesu mnzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kakwingila Yerusalemu kwa ndeng'elo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohn 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Hawapfikile habehi na Yerusalemu, habehi ne imiji ya Betifage na Betaniya, kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni, Yesu kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli walongole. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Kawalongela, “Mghende mne ichijiji ichili hambele henu, hamtsokwingila, mtsomwona imwana we ipunda kohighwa, naye yang'ali kudinighwa ne imunu. Mumdohole, mumghale hano. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Imunu wowose ang'awaghutsa, ‘Ebali mtenda apfo?’ Mumlongele, ‘Imtwatsa kombama, kuya katsomuyitsa sambi.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Iwanang'ina wala woka, wamwona imwana we ipunda kohighwa hane libani. Hawang'ali womdohola, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />iwanu wangi iwemile hala wawaghutsa, “Mtenda choni? Mwomdohola imwana we ipunda?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Wawedika ka Yesu pfayawalongele ne iwanu awo wawaleka woke naye. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Wamghala imwana we ipunda ayo kwa Yesu, kuya weka ghamaghwanda ghawo mchanya mwake, Yesu kakala mchanya mwake. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Iwanu wengi wanzasa ghamaghwanda ghawo mnzila, ne iwanu wangi wabena imiputila mne imighunda, wainzasa mnzila. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ne iwanu iwamlongolele na awala iwamuwinzile wakemelela walonga, “Mumtunitse Imulungu! Yabalikiighwe iyakutsa kwa taghwa lye Imtwatsa! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Imulungu ubaliki Undewa iukutsa wa mndewa wetu Daudi. Mumtunye Imulungu yali kuchanya ng'ani!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu kengila Yerusalemu, kaghenda mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Kalola mmbalimbali chila hanu, lekeni kwaapfila litsua tsaliswa, kaghenda Betaniya ne iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghulighita ghumbiki ghwa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Nemitondo yake hawang'ali wolawa Betaniya, Yesu tsakakala na nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Kaghwona ghumbiki ghwa mtini kwa kutali ghune imitsani mingi. Kaghenda kulola ka kodaha kupata tini. Lekeni hayapfikile ng'apatile bae tini ila imitsani iliyeka, kwaapfila msimu wa tini tsaghung'ali. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Kuya Yesu kaghulongela ghumbiki, “Kulawa lelo na kughendelela, kuduhu imunu iyatsokuja keli ghamatunda ghako.” Ne iwanang'ina wake wamuhulika hayalongile apfo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghenda mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohn 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Hawapfikile Yerusalemu, Yesu kengila mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, kandusa kuwawinga awala iwang'ali wohutsa na kughula mghati mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu. Katsibidula tsimetsa tse iwanu iwotsibena tsisendi na pfighoda pfe iwanu iwohutsa iwanjiwa, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />kawaghoma kusola ichinu chochose mghati mwe Ing'anda ye Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Kuya kawalangulitsa, “Apfi ng'ayandikighwe bae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:17">‘Ing'anda yangu itsokemighwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:17">ing'anda ya ukulombela ye iwanu we isi tsose?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 11:17">Lekeni mwemwe mwoitenda mango ye iwabapfi!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Wapfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso hawahulike apfi, wandusa kubama inzila ya kumkoma Yesu. Lekeni wang'ali wompfuka, kwaapfila iwanu wose wang'ali wokangawala kwa ghamalangulitso ghake.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Mihe haipfikile, Yesu ne iwanang'ina wake woka mne ghumji agho.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso ghe ghumtini ghunyalile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Nemitondo yake, hawang'ali woghenda waghwona ghumtini ghula ghunyala kulawa msina. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petiri kakumbuka chayalongile Yesu, kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, ulole! Imbiki ghughulighite ghunyala!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu kedika, “Mumtoghole Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nowalongela ghendo, imunu wowose ang'achilongela chidunda chino, ‘Ghenda wiyase mwibahali’ na ka ng'akwalangula mne ghumoyo ghwake na kutoghola chayalongile chitsolawila, chitsotendeka kwaajili yake. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Apfo nowalongela, hamlomba na kulomba ghoghose, mtoghole ka mwoghabokela, nagho ghatsokuwa ghenu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Na hamlomba, ka kuna imunu kakutendela pfihile, umleghusile ghamatotso ghake, naye Aba wenu yali kulanga katsowaleghusila nzambi tsenu.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Lekeni ka ng'amuwaleghusila ghamatotso ghawo, naye Aba wenu yali kulanga ng'atsowaleghusila nzambi tsenu bae.<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukulu wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Wapfika keli Yerusalemu, na Yesu hayang'ali koghenda ghenda mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, pfilongotsi we inambiko, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwabala wamghendela. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Wamghutsa, “Kwa ukulu wachi kotenda ipfinu pfino? Na yuhi iyakwing'ile ukulu uno wa kutenda ghano?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu kawedika, “Na nene nowaghutsa imbuli imwe, mnyidike, nani nitsowalongela kwa ukulu wachi notenda ghano ghose. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Mnilongele, ubatitso wa Yohane ulawa kulanga au kwe iwanu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Weghutsa, walonga, “Tung'alonga ‘Ulawa kulanga’ katsotughutsa, ‘Ebali lelo ng'amtoghole?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Lekeni tung'alonga, ‘Ulawa kwe iwanu.’ ” Wawapfuka iwanu, kwaapfila iwanu wose tsawamanya Yohane tsakakala nabii. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Apfo wamwidika, “Ng'atumanyile bae.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Yesu kawalongela, “Na nene siwalongela bae yuhi iyangaile ukulu wa kutenda ghano.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye iwakulima na mghunda ghwa mitsabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu kandusa kulonga nawo kwa imbuli, “Imunu yumwe tsakahanda mitsabibu mne mghunda. Kuya kaghutsengela luwa, kahimba hanu ha ukukamila na kutsenga chilingilo. Keka wemilitsi, kuya koka isi ya kutali.<figure style="fig" file="04 Winepress.jpg" size="col" ref="12:1">4. Iwanu weli wokama tsabibu mne chinu cho ukukamila dipfai</figure> <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Ghumsimu ghwa kupfuna tsabibu haghupfikile, kamtuma imtumwa wake akasole tsabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Lekeni wemilitsi wamghogha, wamtowa, wamuwinga bila kumwing'a chinu. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kuya imunu ayo kamtuma imtumwa yungi. Ayo wamtowa mwitwi na kumtendela pfihile. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Kamtuma yungi, ayo naye wamkoma. Kawatuma iwatumwa wangi wengi, wangi wawatowa na wangi wawakoma. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Yakalile imunu yumwe yaliheka wa kumtuma, naye iye imwanaghe iyamnoghele ng'ani. Kalonga, ‘Ayu wa ukumambulitsa nakwona watsomhulikitsa, kwaapfila ka mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Lekeni wemilitsi wala welongela, ‘Ayu ambe mhala mghunda ghuno. Leka tumkome ili mghunda ghuno ghuwe ghwetu!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Wamghogha, wamkoma, wamwasa kunze kwe mghunda.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Yesu kaghutsa, “Imunu yane mghunda yatsotendatse? Katsakutsa kuwakoma wemilitsi wose na kuweng'a iwanu wangi mghunda aghwo. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ng'amsomile bae liandiko ililonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Libwe lyawalilemile iwotsenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">Alyo liwa libwe kulu lya haghati.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Imbuli ino ilawa kwe Imtwatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">nayo yotukangawatsa!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Tsawabama kumghogha kwaapfila tsawamanya ka imbuli yailongile kawalonga wawo, ila wawapfuka iwanu. Apfo wamleka yaliyeka, woka.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ye ukuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Hambele, wawatuma Mafarisayo wangi ne iwanu wa kingili lya Herodi kuna Yesu ili wamteghe ghayolonga. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Wamghendela, walonga, “Imlangulitsi, twokumanya ghweghwe kwa imunu yulongesa ghendo, na ng'aupfuka bae ukulu we imunu, wala ng'aulola ipfihanga pfe iwanu. Lekeni kwoilangulitsa ghendo inzila ye Imulungu. Utulongele, apfi pfinogha au ng'apfinoghile bae kuliha kodi kwa Kaisari? Tumlihe au tuleke kumliha?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Lekeni Yesu kamanya ung'enye wawo. Kawaghutsa, “Ule mwobama kunitegha? Ngalileni sendi ayo niyone.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Wamghalila sendi ayo. Naye kawaghutsa, “Angu ichihanga chino na taghwa lino lya nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Wamwidika, “Pfa Kaisari.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Kuya Yesu kawalongela, “Mmwing'e Kaisari pfa Kaisari na mmwing'e Imulungu pfe Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya ukutsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Kuya Masadukayo, iwanu iwolonga kuduhu ukutsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa wamghendela Yesu wamghutsa, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mlangulitsi, Musa tsakatwandikila pfino, ka imunu indughu yake kafa, naye kamleka mwehe iyalihela iwana, ndughu we imunu ayo kobamighwa amkwele chitsuka ayo ili amwelekele ndughu yake iwana. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Tsakukala ne iwandughu saba. Imkulu wawo kakwela, naye kafa bila kuleka imwana wowose. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ndughu wa keli kamkwela chitsuka ayo, naye kafa bila kweleka imwana. Ilawila pfipfo kwa ndughu wa kadatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Iwandughu wose saba wafa na ng'awalekile imwana bae. Kuya mwehe yula naye kafa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Lelo iwanu hawatsotsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa, angu mwehe ayo yakuwa wa nani kwaapfila wose saba tsawamkwela?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu kawedika, “Mwemwe mwakwagha kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka wala ngupfu ye Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Iwanu iwafile hawatsotsilihuka, ng'awatsokwela wala kukwelighwa bae, watsakuwa ka wamalaika wa kulanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Kwe imbuli ya ukutsilihuka kwe iwanu iwafile, apfi ng'amsomile bae imbuli ya libagho ilikwaka mne ichitabu cha Musa, Imulungu pfayalongile na Abrahamu, ‘Nene na Imulungu wa Abrahamu, na Imulungu we Isaka na Imulungu wa Yakobu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yeye si Imulungu we iwanu iwafile bae, ila we iwanu waghima. Apfo mwagha ghendo!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghitso kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Imlangulitsi yumwe wa ghamalaghitso katsa kawahulika wodawala. Hayonile Yesu kawedika ghoya kamghutsa, “Mne ghamalaghitso ghose, lihi laghitso kulu kubita ghose?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu kedika, “Laghitso kulu alino. ‘Mtegheletse mwemwe Waisiraeli! Imtwatsa Imulungu wetu ka Imtwatsa yumwe yaliyeka. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mnoghele Imulungu wako kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose na kwa muhe wako wose na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose na kwa ngupfu tsako tsose.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Na laghitso lya keli, ‘Mnoghele imunu wa habehi yako, ka pfawinoghela imwenyegho.’ Kuduhu laghitso kulu kubita agha meli.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Imlangulitsi ayo wa ghamalaghitso kamlongela Yesu, “Mlangulitsi, kwidika ghoya. Kulongesa ghendo, Imulungu ka yumwe na kuduhu imulungu yungi ila yeye. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Na kumnoghela Imulungu kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose na kwa tsimbutsi tsako tsose na kwa ngupfu tsako tsose, na kumnoghela imunu wa habehi yako ka pfawinoghela ghwe imwenyegho pfinogha ghendo kubita kumlapfila Imulungu inambiko.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu hayonile kedika kwa ihekima, kamlongela, “Ng'uli kutali bae na Undewa we Imulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kulawa baho, kuduhu imunu iyaghetsile kumghutsa Yesu imbuli yoyose.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imbuli ya Kiristu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa mne ing'anda ye Imulungu, kawaghutsa, “Ebali iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wolonga Kiristu kaimwana wa Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka tsakamlongotsa Daudi, naye kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Imtwatsa kamlongela Imtwatsa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">Ukale ghumoko ghwangu ghwa kujilo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">mbaka niweke iwehile wako</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">hasi ha ghamaghulu ghako.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />“Daudi imwenyegho tsakamkema ‘Imtwatsa.’ Apfi Kiristu yodahatse kuwa imwanaghe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Iwanu wengi wamhulikitsa kwa kudeng'elela.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalongela iwanu walangitse na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Yesu hayang'ali yolangulitsa kalonga, “Mwalangitse na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso. Wonoghela kupfala ghamaghwanda matali na kulamsighwa mmasoko. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Na wosaghula ipfighoda ipfili hambele mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela na kukala hanu hanoghile mne ipfihungo. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Wakuja mne tsing'anda tse pfitsuka, kwa kwilangusa wanogha, wolomba bila kwipfa. Awo watsohighighwa ng'ani.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya chitsuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu tsakakala habehi na chinu cha kwikila sadaka, kalola iwanu pfawoghela tsisendi. Matajiri wengi walapfa sendi nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kuya katsa chitsuka yumwe mhingwa kaghela sendi mbili. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu kawakema iwanang'ina wake kalonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, chitsuka yuno keka nyingi kubita wose. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Wose walapfa tsimali tsawo itsiswelele, lekeni chitsuka yuno kalapfa pfose pfalinapfo.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga imbuli ya kuhinyighwa kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu hayang'ali yolawa kunze kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu, yumwe wa imwanang'ina wake kamlongela, “Mlangulitsi, ulole ghamabwe na tsing'anda pfatsinoghile!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu kamwidika, “Apfi kwotsona tsing'anda tsino ng'ulu? Ng'alitsolekighwa libwe mchanya mwe libwe lingi, chila limwe litsakwasighwa hasi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kughaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu tsakakala mchidando mwa Chidunda cha Mitseituni, kumwambu kwe ing'anda ye Imulungu. Petiri, Jakobu, Yohane ne Andereya wamghutsa hawakalile waliyeka. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Utulongele, agha ghose ghatsolawila tsuwachi? Na kutsakuwa na chitango chachi agha ghose haghatsolawila?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mwalangitse, imunu aleke kuwaghutsukila. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Iwanu wengi watsakutsa kwa taghwa lyangu, watsolonga, ‘Nene na yeye!’ Na watsowaghutsukila iwanu wengi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Namwe hamtsohulika ng'ondo na mbuli tsa ng'ondo, mleke kupfuka. Ipfinu apfo pfobamighwa pfilawile, ila utsighilo ung'ali kutsa. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Iwanu we isi watsetowa ne iwanu wa isi ingi, undewa utsetowa ne undewa ungi, ne isi itsoking'isika chila hanu, na kutsolawila nzala ng'ulu. Agha ghose ghatsakuwa ka mwanduso wa usungu we kweleka.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Namwe mwalangitse! Mtsoghoghighwa na kughalighwa mne libaratsa. Mtsotowighwa mne tsing'anda tsa ukulombela. Mtsakwima hambele he iwabala na iwandewa kwaajili yangu kuwalongela mbuli tsinoghile. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Na Imbuli Inoghile ye Imulungu yobamighwa kupetighwa mne tsiisi tsose. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Hawatsowaghogha na kuwaghala kune libaratsa, mleke ukwalangula cha ukulonga. Mlonge chochose chila chamtsakwing'ighwa, kwaapfila si mwemwe bae yamlonga, ila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Ndughu katsomlapfa ndughu yake yakomighwe, na aba katsomlapfa imwanaghe yakomighwe. Iwana watsowalema na kuwakoma aba na mai tsawo. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Iwanu wose watsowahila kwa taghwa lyangu, ila ayula yoghendelela mbaka usighilo katsokombolighwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamaghayo makulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Hamtsakwona lideso lima hanu hang'alibamighwa kwima bae. (Imunu iyosoma amanye) Awala iwali mne isi ya Yudeya watsumile mpfidunda. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Imunu wowose iyali mkano aleke kuhulumka hasi, au kwingila mng'anda kulapfa ichinu chochose kunze. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Na yula iyali kumghunda aleke kuya ukaye kusola ghamaghwanda ghake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Watsoghaya ng'ani iwapinga wane tsiinda ne iwapinga iwakong'etsa mne ghamatsuwa agho! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mlombe agho ghaleke kulawila msimu wa chipfeghetsi! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kwaapfila ghamatsuwa agho kutsakuwa na maghayo ighang'ali ghalawile kulawa mwanduso, Imulungu hayalumbile isi yose, mbaka sambi, na ng'aghatsolawila keli! <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Na ka Imtwatsa ng'ahungutse bae ghamatsuwa agho, kuduhu imunu ang'adahile kukombolighwa. Lekeni kwaajili ye iwanu wake iyawasaghule, kahungutsa ghamatsuwa agho.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Mne ghamatsuwa agho, imunu wowose yang'awalongela, ‘Lola, Kiristu kahano!’ Au ‘Kakula!’ Mleke kumtoghola. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Kwaapfila watsolawila tsina Kiristu wa ughutsu na manabii wa ughutsu. Watsotenda ipfinzonza ne ipfitango na kuwaghutsukila hata wala iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu, ka yodahika. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Mwalangitse! Niwalongela chila ichinu ichitsolawila.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutsa kwe Imwana we Imunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Lekeni mna ghamatsuwa agho ahala maghayo aghatsomala, litsua litsakuwa ne ichisi, lwetsi ng'alutsolapfa ghumwanga bae, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />tsinondo tsitsolaghala kulawa mlanga, na ngupfu tsa kulanga tsitsohighitsighwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Baho iwanu watsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakutsa mne ghamawingu kwe ingupfu ng'ulu na utunitso. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Naye katsowatuma wamalaika wake kuwasola awala iyawasaghule mne isi yose, kulawa ubali umwe mbaka ubali ungi!<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso gha mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Mwilangulitse imbuli ino kulawa mne mbiki ghwa mtini. Ghamaputila ghake haghakuwa madeke na kwandusa kutula, mwomanya chihangatsi cha habehi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Pfipfila hamtsakona agha ghose gholawila, mmanye Imwana we Imunu kahabehi ghendo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nowalongela ghendo, iwanu wa mweleko ghuno ng'awatsoluta bae mbaka agha ghose ghalawile. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Kulanga ne isi pfitsoluta, ila mbuli tsangu ng'atsitsoluta bae.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu iyomanya litsuwa wala saa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Kuduhu iyomanya litsuwa lila wala saa ila. Hata wamalaika wa kulanga wala Imwana ng'awomanya, ila Imulungu yaliyeka iyomanya. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mwalangitse, mkale meso kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae itskughwa tsuwachi. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Yeghala ne imunu yokile na kuwaleka iwatumwa wake, chila yumwe ne isang'ano yake. Kuya kamlaghitsa imkalitsi wa libani akale meso. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Apfo mkale meso, kwaapfila ng'ammanya bae yane ing'anda yatsakuya tsuwachi, kakuya nemihe, nechilo, ijogholo hayatsakwika, au nemitondotondo. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ka kakuya kwa kwidukitsa, aleke kuwapfika muwasa. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Achino chaniwalongela, niwalongela iwanu wose. ‘Mwalangitse!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yuda kobama inzila ya kumhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 2:1-5">Mat 2:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohn 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Tsaghakalile matsuwa meli ng'ana ichihungo che Ipasaka na pfighate ipfilihela hamila chipfike. Iwakulu we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wabama inzila ya kumghogha Yesu chinyelenyele na kumkoma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Walonga, “Tuleke kumghogha mne ichihungo che Ipasaka, hela iwanu watsotenda tsogho.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobakighwa ghamafuta ne ipinga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohn 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu tsakakala Betaniya mng'anda mwa Simoni, imunu iyang'ali yoghula ukoma. Hawakalile mmetsa wakuja ichijo cha nemihe, ipinga yumwe iyaghalile ichupa ya ghamafuta ighonung'ila gha bei ng'ulu katsa. Kaipfughula na kamwitila Yesu mwitwi. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Iwanu iwakalile aho tsawona maya, welongela, “Ule kakwaghitsa ghamafuta gha bei ng'ulu? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Ghamafuta ghano ghang'autsighwe kwa bei ng'ulu na sendi weng'ighwe iwahingwa!” Kuya wamkembela ipinga ayo.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Yesu kalonga, “Mlekeni! Ule mumdesa? Yeye kanitendela ichinu chinoghile. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Iwahingwa mwinawo ghamatsuwa ghose, na mwodaha kuwapfila pfopfose pfambama. Lekeni ng'amtsakuwa na nene bae ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Ipinga ayu katenda achila chayadahile. Kalongola kulubaka lukuli lwangu, lukale ghoya kwa kutsikighwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nowalongela ghendo, hanu hohose imbuli inoghile haitsopetighwa mne isi, chayatendile ipinga ayu chitsolongighwa kwa kumkumbuka yeye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotoghola kumhunduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yuda Isikarioti, yumwe wa wala iwanang'ina kumi na weli, kaghenda kwe ipfilongotsi we inambiko ili amhunduke Yesu kuna wawo. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Nawo hawahulike wadeng'elela kwa achila chayalongile, wamlongela watsomwing'a sendi. Apfo kabama nzila ya ukumhunduka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakuja ichijo che Ipasaka ne iwanang'ina wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-23">Luk 22:7-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohn 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mne litsuwa lya mwanduso lye Ichihungo cha Pfighate ipfilihela hamila na litsuwa lya kumkoma imwana we ing'olo we Ipasaka, iwanang'ina wake wamghutsa, “Apfi ubama tughende kwani tukakwikile ichijo cha Ipasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yesu kawatuma iwanang'ina wake weli, kawalongela, “Mghende kune ghumji, mtsetingana ne imunu iyaghalile chiya cha ghamatsi. Mmuwinze <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mbaka kune ing'anda iyatsakwingila, kuya mumlongele imunu yane ing'anda, Imlangulitsi koghutsa, ‘Chilikwani chiheleto cha iwahenza, ili ndiye Ipasaka ne iwanang'ina wangu?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kuya katsowalangusa chiheleto chikulu cha uchanya ichikighwe ghoya. Mtwikile amo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Iwanang'ina tsawoka, waghenda kune ghumji, kuya tsawona ka Yesu pfawalongele. Apfo wachitenga ichijo che Ipasaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Kuya haipfikile nemihe, Yesu kapfika ne iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Bahala hawang'ali wakuja mmetsa, Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela ghendo, imunu yumwe kulawa kuna mwemwe iyakuja na nene, katsonihunduka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Iwanang'ina waghanzika, chila yumwe kamghutsa, “Angu nene?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu kawedika, “Yumwe kulawa mna mwemwe kumi na weli, iyopfabika chighate chake mne bakuli na nene. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Imwana we Imunu katsakufa ka pfayandikighwe. Lekeni katsoghaya imunu yula yomhunduka Imwana we Imunu. Ing'awile ng'apfu kwa imunu yula ka ng'elekighwe bae!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichijo che Imtwatsa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wak 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Hawang'ali wakuja, Yesu kasola chighate, kachibaliki, kachimegha, kaweng'a iwanang'ina wake kawalongela, “Msole, aluno lukuli lwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Kuya kasola chikombe, kachibaliki, kaweng'a, wose wachinwela.<verse eid="MRK 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kawalongela, “Aino idamu yangu ya lilaghano iikwitika kwaajili ye iwanu wengi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nowalongela ghendo, sitsakunwa keli bae dipfai ya mitsabibu mbaka litsuwa lila lyanitsakunwa ingi mne Undewa we Imulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Hawamalitse kwimba wila, waghenda kune Chidunda cha Mitseituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotabili Petiri katsomhunduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wak 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mwemwe wose mtsotsuma na kundeka, ka pfayandikighwe, ‘Nitsomtowa mdimi, ne iwang'olo watsopwililika.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Lekeni hanitsotsilihuka kulawa mne lifwa, nitsowalongola Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petiri kamlongela, “Hata wose wang'akuleka, nene sikuleka bae!”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Lekeni Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela ghendo, leloli nechilo, ijogholo ng'ana yeke lwa keli, kutsonibela mala ndatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Lekeni Petiri kaghendelela kulonga, “Hata ka nobamighwa nife naghwe, mbe, sikubela bae!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Ne iwanang'ina wangi wose walonga pfipfo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolomba mne ibostani ya Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Tsawapfika hanu hokemighwa Getisemane, Yesu kawalongela iwanang'ina wake, “Hanighenda kulomba, mwemwe mkale hano.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Kawasola Petiri, Jakobu na Yohane, naye kandusa kughanzika na kwona usungu ng'ani mne ghumoyo ghwake. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Kawalongela, “Usungu uli mne ghumoyo ghwangu mkulu ng'ani, wodaha kunikoma. Mkale hano na mkale meso.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Kaghenda hambele chidogho, keghwisa hasi, kalomba, ka yodahika aleke kubitila mne ichipindi chila cha kudununzika. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Kalomba, “Aba wangu, ipfinu pfose pfodahika kuna ghweghwe. Uchilapfe chikombe cha kudununzika kuna nene, lekeni si ka pfanibama nene bae, ila pfaubama ghweghwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Kuya koya keli kawapfika iwanang'ina wake wadatu wawasa. Naye kamlongela Petiri, “Simoni, kuwasa? Ng'udahile bae kukala meso hata kwa saa imwe?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Kuya kawalongela iwanang'ina wose, “Mkale meso, mlombe mleke kughetsighwa na ghehile. Ghumoyo ghwobama kutenda ghanoghile, lekeni lukuli lwahela ingupfu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Kaghenda keli kulomba akuno kolonga ghaghala. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Kuya koya keli kawapfika iwanang'ina wake wawasa, ng'awadahile bae kufumbula tsinenge tsawo. Nawo ng'awamanyile bae chakumlongela Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Hayoile lwakadatu, kawalongela, “Mng'ali mwowasa na kubwihila? Lamkeni lelo! Ichipindi chipfika, Imwana we Imunu sambi kakwing'ighwa mne ghamoko ghe iwanu wane nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mwinuke! Tughende! Mlole, ayuno hano imunu yonihunduka nene!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koghoghighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohn 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu hayang'ali yolonga, Yuda, yumwe we iwanang'ina wake kumi na weli, tsakapfika. Katsa na kingili lye iwanu iwakindile imimaghe ne ipfilungu. Tsawatumighwa na ipfilongotsi we inambiko, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso ne iwabala. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda kaling'a ichitango kingili alyo. “Imunu yanitsomnonela iyo yamumbama. Mumghoghe, mumghale na mumlolese aleke kutsuma.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Bahala Yuda hayapfikile, kamghendela Yesu kalonga, “Mlangulitsi!” Kuya kamnonela. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Apfo, wamkinda, wamghogha Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Lekeni imunu yumwe mne iwanu iwemile hala, kalapfa limaghe lyake kamtowa imtumwa we Ichilongotsi we Inambiko, kamghana ghutwi lyake.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu kawalongela, “Pfii mtsa hano ne imimaghe ne ipfilungu kunighogha ka nene nambapfi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Chila litsuwa tsanahamwe namwe, nolangulitsa mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu, ng'amnighoghile bae. Lekeni leka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka ghatimilike.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Kuya iwanang'ina wose wamleka, watsuma.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Na imsongolo yumwe iyeghubike ligholole yang'ali yomuwinza Yesu. Hawabamile kumghogha, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kalileka ligholole lyake, katsuma chidako.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamne libaratsa lye iwabala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohn 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Kuya wamghala Yesu mne ing'anda ye Ichilongotsi we Inambiko, baho ipfilongotsi we inambiko, iwabala ne iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wose wetingana hamwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petiri yang'ali yomuinzilitsa Yesu kwa kutali, kengila mne luwa lya Ichilongotsi we Inambiko, kakala ne iwakalitsi, na yang'ali yakota ghumoto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Iwakulu we inambiko ne iwanu wose mne libaratsa wabama ukalangama wamwing'e maghomba Yesu ili wadahe kumkoma, lekeni ng'awadahile bae kuupata. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Iwanu wengi walonga ughutsu kuna Yesu, lekeni ukalangama wawo ng'awighalile bae.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Iwanu wamwenga wenuka, walonga ukalangama wa ughutsu, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Tsatumhulika kolonga, ‘Nitsoihinya Ing'anda ino ye Imulungu iitsengighwe kwa ghamoko na litsuwa lya kadatu nitsotsenga ingi ing'aitsengighwe kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Hata apfo, ukalangama wawo ng'awighalile bae.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ichilongotsi we Inambiko kenuka hambele he iwanu kamghutsa Yesu, “Pfii kwahela chakwidika mne ukalangama uno iwaulapfile hano?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Lekeni Yesu kenyamala, ng'alongile bae. Ichilongotsi we Inambiko kamghutsa keli, “Apfi ghweghwe kwa Kiristu, Imwana we Imulungu Yetunyighwe?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu kalonga, “Ona nene. Wose mtsomwona Imwana we Imunu kakala mne ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwe Imulungu yane Ingupfu, kakutsa mne ghamawingu gha kulanga.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Baho Ichilongotsi we Inambiko kadegha lighwanda lyake, kaghutsa, “Lelo twobama wakalangama wangi wachi? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ambe mumhulika pfayamlighile Imulungu! Mwemwe mkwonatse?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Wose wamhigha yakomighwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Iwanu wangi wandusa kumbwalulila Yesu ghamate, wamghubika tsinenge tsake, wamtowa, wamlongela, “Utange, yuhi yakutowile!” Pfipfila iwakalitsi wamsola, wamtowa.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petiri kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohn 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petiri hayang'ali kamne luwa, ipinga yumwe imtumwa we Imtambika mkulu katsa. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Hayamwonile Petiri kakota ghumoto, kamtsodolela tsinenge, kalonga, “Pfipfila naghwe tsa kwahamwe na Yesu Mnatsareti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Lekeni Petiri kabela, “Simmanyile bae, wala sichimanyile bae chaulonga.” Kuya kalawa kunze mbaka hachikuta, ijogholo keka. <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Imtumwa yula hayamwonile keli hala, kawalongela iwanu iwemile hala. Ayuno naye yumwe wawo. <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petiri kabela keli. Hambele chidogho, awala iwemile hala wamghendela. Wamlongela, “Ghweghwe kwa yumwe wawo ghendo, kwaapfila ghweghwe kwa Mgalilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Petiri kandusa kwilighita na kwilaha kuna wawo, “Simmanyile bae imunu yamlonga mbuli tsake.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Bahala ijogholo keka lwakeli, kuya Petiri kakumbuka imbuli ila Yesu iyamlongele, “Ijogholo ng'ana yeke lwa keli, kutsonibela mala ndatu.” Kandusa kulila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koghalighwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohn 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Nemitondotondo, ipfilongotsi we inambiko wetingana hamwe ne iwabala, iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso na libaratsa lyose, walamla kumghala Yesu kwa Pilato. Apfo wamwoha, wamghala na wamwing'a Pilato.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato kamghutsa Yesu, “Apfi ghweghwe kwaimndewa wa Wayahudi?” Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, ka ghweghwe pfaulonga.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Iwakulu we inambiko wamghutsukila Yesu maghomba mengi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Apfo, Pilato kamghutsa Yesu keli, “Ng'ukwidika chochose bae? Tegheletsa ghamaghomba ghawo ghose kuna ghweghwe.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Lekeni Yesu kalema kwidika keli, Pilato kakangawala.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohighighwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohn 18:39–19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Chila Ichihungo che Ipasaka, Pilato tsakatsowela kumlekelela imunu yumwe yohighwe yobamighwa ne iwanu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Ichipindi acho kukala ne imunu yumwe yakemighwe Baraba, wamwika mne chifungo hamwe ne iwanu iwatendile hengele na iwakomile iwanu mna tsogho kulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Na kingili lye iwanu limghendela Pilato na limlomba awatendele ka pfayatendagha. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Naye Pilato kawaghutsa, “Apfi, mwobama nimlekelele Imndewa wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Pilato kamanya ghendo ka pfilongotsi we inambiko wamghala Yesu kuna yeye kwaapfila wamwonela chepfu.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Lekeni ipfilongotsi we inambiko wawaswangitsa iwanu wamlombe Pilato amlekelele Baraba ihanu ha Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato kawaghutsa iwanu awo, “Kuya mwobama nimtende choni imunu yamumkema Imndewa wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Iwanu wose wakemelela walonga, “Mkondeke mna msalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato kawaghutsa, “Apfi atendile choni chihile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Walonga keli kwa kukemelela, “Mkondeke mna msalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato kabama kuwadeng'eletsa iwanu, apfo kamlekelela Baraba. Kuya kalaghitsa Yesu yafapulighwe ipfiboko, kuya wamkondeke mna msalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asikali wombetsa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohn 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Asikali wamghala Yesu mghati mwe ing'anda ye imkulu we isi ya Yudeya, wawakema hamwe wayawo wose. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wampfatsa Yesu lighwanda lya langi ya tsambarau, wabota litaji lya mihonga, walika mwitwi mwake. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Kuya wandusa kumlamsa, “Mbukwa Imndewa wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Waghendelela kumtowa ne ng'weku mwitwi mwake na kumbwalulila ghamate. Watowa ghamaghoti, wamwinamila. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Kuya hawamalitse kumbetsa, wamtsula lighwanda lya langi ya tsambarau wampfatsa ghamaghwanda ghake. Kuya wamlapfa kunze wamkondeka mne msalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokondekighwa mne msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohn 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Hawakalile mnzila, wetingana ne imunu iyakemighwe Simoni, imunu wa Kirene, aba wawo Alekisanda na Lufo. Imunu ayo tsayang'ali yolawa kumghunda koghenda mne ghumji. Asikali wambama aghughale msalaba ghwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Kuya wamghala Yesu hanu hokemighwa Goligota, mana yake, “Hanu ha Pala lya Litwi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Wamwing'a idipfai ihanganyighwe na manemane, lekeni Yesu kalema kuinwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Kuya wamkondeka mna msalaba, wegholela ghamaghwanda ghake kwa ukwasa hasi tsisimbi walole yuhi yapate lighwanda. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ikala saa ndatu nemitondo hawamkondeke Yesu mna msalaba. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Wandika lighomba lyake apfino. “IMNDEWA WA WAYAHUDI.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Kuya wamkondeka Yesu hamwe na wabapfi weli mne misalaba, yumwe kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kujilo na yungi kune ghumoko ghwake ghwa kumoso. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Apfo ghatimila Ghamaandiko igholonga, “Tsakekighwa hamwe iwanu wehile.”<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Iwanu iwang'ali woluta hanu hala wahighitsa ghamatwi ghawo, wamligha Yesu, walonga, “Ambe ghweghwe kudaha kuimwagha Ing'anda ye Imulungu na kuitsenga kwa ghamatsuwa madatu! <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Hulumka lelo mna msalaba, wihonetse mwenyegho!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Pfipfila ipfilongotsi we inambiko na iwolangulitsa Ghamalaghitso wamligha Yesu, walonga, “Kawahonetsa iwanu wengi lekeni ng'odaha bae kwihonetsa imwenyegho! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Leka tumlole ayu Kiristu, Imndewa wa Isiraeli, sambi ahulumke mna msalaba, na twetwe tutsomtoghola!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Kuya, iwanu wala weli iwakondekighwe mne misalaba hamwe na Yesu pfipfila wamligha.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kakufa mna msalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohn 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Haipfikile saa sita nemisi, isi yose ighubikighwa ne ichisi ichikalile kwa masaa madatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Saa tisa nemisi, Yesu kakemelela, “Eloi, Eloi, lama Sabakitani” mana yake, “Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu, mbona kundeka?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Iwanu wangi iwemile hala hawahulike apfo walonga, “Tegheletsa, komkema Eliya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Imunu yumwe katsuma, keka isiki mne lidodoki, kalika mne lubiki, kamwing'a Yesu yainwe. Kuya kalonga, “Tubete tulole ka Eliya kakutsa kumhulumsa mna msalaba.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yesu kalila kwa kukemelela, kuya kafa.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Lipanziya likalile mne Ing'anda ye Imulungu lidegheka mabwende meli kulawa kuchanya mbaka hasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Imbala yumwe wa asikali iyemile hambele ha msalaba kona Yesu pfayafile, kalonga, “Imunu yuno tsakakala Imwana we Imulungu ghendo!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Iwapinga wamwenga tsawalola kwa kutali. Wamwenga wawo tsa Mariya Magidalena, Mariya iyali mai wawo tsina Jakobu mdodo na Yose, na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Yesu hayang'ali Galilaya, iwapinga awo tsawamuwinza wamtumikila. Iwapinga wamwenga iwalawile naye Yerusalemu pfipfila tsawabahala.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotsikighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohn 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Ipfika nemihe ya litsuwa lya kwiyandaa, (tsa tsuwa limwe likalile kupfika tsuwa lya sabato). <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefu iyolawila mne ghumji ghwa Arimataya, imunu wa libaratsa iyahulikitsighwe ng'ani kapfika. Imunu ayo yang'ali yokalitsa ukutsa kwa undewa we Imulungu. Yosefu kamghendela Pilato bila kumpfuka, kamlomba amwing'e lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato tsakakangawala hayahulike ma Yesu kafa. Kamkema imbala wa asikali kamghutsa ka Yesu kafa mwande. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Baho hayahulike apfo kulawa kwe imbalayo, Pilato kamlongela Yosefu alusole lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefu kaghula isanda, kahulumsa lukuli lwa Yesu, kalupfatsa isanda na kulwika mne likabuli ilihimbighwe mne libambalawe. Kuya, kabimbilisa libwe kulu hambele ha libani. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mariya Magidalena na Mariya mai wake Yose wona hanu halwikighwe lukuli lwa Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kutsilihuka kwa Yesu kulawa mne lifwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohn 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Litsuwa lya Sabato halimalile, Mariya Magidalena, Mariya mai wake Jakobu na Salome waghula ghamafuta, waghenda kulubaka lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Nemitondo Jumapili litsua halilawile, waghenda kune likabuli. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Hawang'ali wamnzila weghutsa, “Yuhi yatsolibimbilisa libwe lili mne libani lye likabuli?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Lekeni hawalolile, walyona libwe lila likulu libimbilisighwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Apfo wengila mne likabuli, wamwona imunu yapfalile lighwanda tselu, nawo wakangawala.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Imunu yula kawalongela, “Mleke kukangawala, mwombama Yesu Mnatsareti yawambighwe. Ng'alibaha bae, katsilihuka! Mlole hanu hawamwikile. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Lelo mghende mkawalongele iwanang'ina wake na Petiri, ‘Yesu kowalongola Galilaya, baho mtsomwona ka pfawalongele.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Apfo walawa kunze mwe likabuli, watsuma aku wodedema na kukangawala. Ng'awamlongele imunu wowose bae imbuli ayo kwaapfila tsawapfuka.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlawila Mariya Magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohn 20:11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu hayatsilihuke kulawa mne lifwa lupfilipfili mne litsuwa lya Jumapili, kamlawila Mariya Magidalena iyamlapfile ipfinyamkela saba. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Naye kaghenda kuwalongela wayaghe awala iwakalile na Yesu, iwang'ali wakona usungu na kulila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Hawahulike Yesu katsilihuka na ipinga ayo kamwona, ng'awatoghole bae.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina weli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24:13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Hambele Yesu kawalawila iwanang'ina wake weli aku kana chihanga chingi, hawang'ali woghenda kumghunda. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Nawo woya wawalongela wayawo. Lekeni nawo ng'awatoghole bae.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohn 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ghama 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Hambele chidogho Yesu kawalawila iwanang'ina kumi na yumwe hawang'ali wakuja. Kawakembela kwaapfila ng'awang'ali wotoghola bae na wasughu kuwatoghola awala iwamwonile kamghima. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Apfo kawalongela, “Mghende mne isi yose muwapetele Imbuli Inoghile wapfilumbe wose. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Imunu wowose iyotoghola na kubatitsighwa, katsokombolighwa, ila imunu wowose iyolema kutoghola katsohighighwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Na ipfitango pfino pfoghenda hamwe na awala iwotoghola, Kwa taghwa lyangu watsolapfa ipfinyamkela, na watsolonga kwa lugha ya sambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Hata wang'akinda iwanzoka na kunwa sumu ng'awatsolaghighwa bae. Watsowekila ghamoko ghawo iwatamu, nawo watsohona.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Yesu hayamalitse kulonga ne iwanang'ina wake, kasolighwa kulanga, kakala ghumoko ghwa kujilo ghwe Imulungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Kuya iwanang'ina wala waghenda chila hanu kupeta Imbuli Inoghile. Ne Imtwatsa kasang'ana nawo, kalangusa ka kahamwe nawo kwe ipfitango ipfighalile ne Imbuli ayo.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>